msgid "Adrenaline Pump CBM"
msgid_plural "Adrenaline Pump CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: アドレナリン刺激装置"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Adrenaline Pump CBM'}
#: data/json/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A stimulator system that is implanted alongside the adrenal glands, allowing"
" the user to trigger their body's adrenaline response at the cost of some "
"bionic power."
msgstr "副腎にアドレナリン刺激装置を埋め込みます。この装置は電力を消費してアドレナリンラッシュを引き起こします。"

