"Gauntlets crafted from the carefully cleaned and pruned biosilicified "
"exoskeletons of acidic ants.  Acid-resistant and very durable."
msgstr "バイオシリコン製の強酸アリの外骨格を丁寧に洗浄して組み上げたガントレットです。耐酸性と耐久性に優れています。"

#: data/json/items/armor/gloves.json
msgid "fencing gauntlet"
msgid_plural "fencing gauntlets"
msgstr[0] "フェンシンググローブ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fencing gauntlet'}
#: data/json/items/armor/gloves.json
