msgstr "シーク教徒の男性が携行する儀式用の短剣です。あまり出来が良くないようです。"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "nodachi"
msgid_plural "nodachi"
msgstr[0] "野太刀"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'nodachi'}
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This is a huge, curved, two-handed sword from Japan.  It is surprisingly "
"light for its size."
msgstr "日本伝来の大型で反りのある両手持ちの刀です。大きさの割には軽量です。"

