msgstr[0] "調理器具(ランプオイル)"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'lamp oil cooker'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This is a simple heater powered by lamp oil.  It is designed for cooking "
"food."
msgstr "ランプオイルを燃料とするシンプルなヒーターです。調理をする際に使います。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "pasta extruder"
