#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight one-handed combat hatchet typically made of stone or bone, "
"originally used by the Algonquian people.  It makes for a half decent tool "
"and weapon."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid "copper tomahawk"
msgid_plural "copper tomahawks"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'copper tomahawk'}
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight one-handed combat hatchet made using basic copper.  Slightly "
"better than stone, though not as historically accurate."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid "sandpaper"
msgid_plural "sandpapers"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sandpaper'}
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid ""
"A sheet of cloth or paper with an abrasive material glued to one side, "
"historically glass or sand, modernly aluminum oxide or silicon carbide.  It "
"is commonly used to smooth, roughen, or strip a wooden surface."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "pallet of wet adobe bricks"
msgid_plural "pallets of wet adobe bricks"
msgstr[0] "日干しレンガパレット(未乾燥)"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'pallet of wet adobe bricks', 'str_pl':
#. 'pallets of wet adobe bricks'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "You test the bricks, and they're solid enough to use."
msgstr "レンガを確認すると、十分に硬くなっているようです。"

#. ~ Use action not_ready_msg for {'str': 'pallet of wet adobe bricks',
#. 'str_pl': 'pallets of wet adobe bricks'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "The bricks are still too damp to bear weight."
msgstr "レンガはまだ湿っており、耐久性が不十分です。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pallet of wet adobe bricks', 'str_pl': 'pallets
#. of wet adobe bricks'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"A pallet full of heavy mud bricks which need to dry slowly to be usable."
msgstr "泥製の重いレンガを満載したパレットです。使える状態になるまでゆっくり乾かす必要があります。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "pallet of dry adobe bricks"
msgid_plural "pallets of dry adobe bricks"
msgstr[0] "日干しレンガパレット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pallet of dry adobe bricks', 'str_pl': 'pallets
#. of dry adobe bricks'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"A pallet of humble mud bricks that have dried out while you were out risking"
" your life.  Disassemble it to retrieve your frame and building supplies."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "pallet of wet ceramic"
msgid_plural "pallets of wet ceramic"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'pallet of wet ceramic', 'str_pl': 'pallets of
#. wet ceramic'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "You test the ceramic, and it's the right consistency to use."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Use action not_ready_msg for {'str': 'pallet of wet ceramic', 'str_pl':
#. 'pallets of wet ceramic'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "The ceramic is still too damp to be used."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pallet of wet ceramic', 'str_pl': 'pallets of
#. wet ceramic'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"A pallet full of crushed wet ceramic, which needs to dry slowly to be "
"usable."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "pallet of ceramic clay"
msgid_plural "pallets of ceramic clay"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pallet of ceramic clay', 'str_pl': 'pallets of
#. ceramic clay'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"A pallet of ceramic clay which is now ready to be made into pottery.  "
"Disassemble it to retrieve your sheet, frame and crafting supplies."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "acetylene-gas machine"
msgid_plural "acetylene-gas machines"
msgstr[0] "アセチレンガス生成機"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'acetylene-gas machine'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This bulky device takes water and calcium carbide and yields unpressurised "
"acetylene."
msgstr "水と炭化カルシウムから非加圧のアセチレンを作り出す大がかりな装置です。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "angle grinder"
msgid_plural "angle grinders"
msgstr[0] "アングルグラインダー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'angle grinder'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This widespread powertool is often used for removing excess material or "
"polishing surfaces."
msgstr "素材の表面の平滑化や研磨をする際に使う一般的な電動工具です。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "brick kiln"
msgid_plural "brick kilns"
msgstr[0] "レンガ窯"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'brick kiln'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a portable charcoal-fired kiln.  It is designed for firing bricks, "
"but you could use it to fire anything made of clay."
msgstr "炭を燃やして使う携帯型の窯です。レンガを焼成するためのものですが、粘土で作ったものを焼くこともできます。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "carding paddles"
msgid_plural "pairs of carding paddles"
msgstr[0] "ハンドカード器"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'carding paddles', 'str_pl': 'pairs of carding
#. paddles'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"A pair of toothy wooden paddles used to clean fibers for use in textile "
"production."
msgstr "繊維を均して布製品を作るための、2枚の木製の櫛です。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "paint chipper"
msgid_plural "paint chippers"
msgstr[0] "ペイントスクレーパー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'paint chipper'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "A tool similar to a chisel, designed to remove paint."
msgstr "塗料を剥がし取る時に使う、ノミに似た道具です。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "clamp"
msgid_plural "clamps"
msgstr[0] "かすがい"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'clamp'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This clamp is useful for keeping things still, especially if you have "
"several of them."
msgstr "複数の資材を繋げて固定する際に役立つ道具です。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "claw bar"
msgid_plural "claw bars"
msgstr[0] "小型バール"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'claw bar'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a small prying tool with a clawed bend at one end for pulling "
"spikes.  Use it to open locked doors without destroying them or to lift "
"manhole covers.  You could also wield it to bash some heads in."
msgstr ""
"曲がった部分を釘などに引っかけてこじ開ける小型の工具です。使用することで鍵のかかった扉を破壊せずに解錠し、マンホールの蓋を持ち上げます。もちろん、誰かの頭に叩きつけることもできますよ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "concrete mixer"
msgid_plural "concrete mixers"
msgstr[0] "コンクリートミキサー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'concrete mixer'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"A portable concrete mixer.  It is still large and heavy, but it can be "
"operated solo, and runs on batteries.  It also has a heater built in."
msgstr "持ち運びできるコンクリートミキサーです。大きくて重いですが、一人で操作でき、電池で駆動します。ヒーターが内蔵されています。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "cordless drill"
msgid_plural "cordless drills"
msgstr[0] "電動ドリル"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cordless drill'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a cordless battery-powered drill with a selection of drill bits."
msgstr "電池で稼働するコードレスハンドドリルです。付け替え用の先端部品がいくつか付属しています。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "distaff and spindle"
msgid_plural "distaves and spindles"
msgstr[0] "糸巻き棒と紡錘"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'distaff and spindle', 'str_pl': 'distaves and
#. spindles'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"A pair of specialized wooden rods used to spin fibers into thread and yarn."
msgstr "糸を紡ぐために使用する、特殊な形をした2本の棒です。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "electric jackhammer"
msgid_plural "electric jackhammers"
msgstr[0] "電動ジャックハンマー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'electric jackhammer'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a construction tool for drilling through hard rock or other "
"surfaces.  It runs on a rechargeable cell, optionally compatible with UPS.  "
"Use it to blast a hole in adjacent solid terrain."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "hacksaw"
msgid_plural "hacksaws"
msgstr[0] "弓鋸"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hacksaw'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "This is a sturdy saw, useful for cutting through metal objects."
msgstr "金属製品を切断する際に用いられる頑丈なノコギリです。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "wire saw"
msgid_plural "wire saws"
msgstr[0] "糸ノコ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wire saw'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a flexible saw made from thin wire, with simple handles on either "
"end.  It should suffice for light metal and wood sawing, or for cutting "
"chain-link fences."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "hammer"
msgid_plural "hammers"
msgstr[0] "ハンマー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hammer'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a demagnetized steel claw hammer with a wooden grip.  With a hammer,"
" nails, and two by fours in your inventory, you could board up adjacent "
"doors and windows.  It has myriad other uses as well."
msgstr ""
"持ち手が木製になっている、磁気除去済みの鋼鉄製くぎ抜き金づちです。ハンマー、釘、木材を所持していれば、隣接したドアや窓に板を打ち付けることができます。その他にも無数の用途があります。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "bronze hammer"
msgid_plural "bronze hammers"
msgstr[0] "ハンマー(青銅)"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bronze hammer'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a bronze claw hammer with a wooden grip, commonly used where sparks "
"from a steel hammer might be a safety hazard.  You could board up adjacent "
"doors and windows, among myriad other uses."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "hand drill"
msgid_plural "hand drills"
msgstr[0] "手回しドリル"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hand drill'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"A primitive manual drill with a single drill bit.  It is slow and it will "
"exhaust you quickly."
msgstr "原始的な手回し式のドリルです。ドリルビットはひとつだけです。穴を空けるのに時間がかかり、疲れます。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "rubber hose"
msgid_plural "rubber hoses"
msgstr[0] "ゴムホース"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'rubber hose'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a flexible rubber hose.  It could be used for crafting, or siphoning"
" fuel from a vehicle."
msgstr "柔軟なゴムホースです。製作用の材料になりますが、車両から燃料を抜き取ることも可能です。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "bottle jack"
msgid_plural "bottle jacks"
msgstr[0] "ボトルジャッキ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bottle jack'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "A portable hydraulic bottle jack used for lifting vehicles."
msgstr "車両を持ち上げるのに使用する、携帯可能な油圧式ボトルジャッキです。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "makeshift jack"
msgid_plural "makeshift jacks"
msgstr[0] "簡易ジャッキ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'makeshift jack'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"A poorly constructed improvised scissor jack used for lifting vehicles if "
"you're brave enough to use it."
msgstr "みすぼらしい造りの即席シザースジャッキです。これを使う勇気があるなら、車両を持ち上げるのに使用できます。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "scissor jack"
msgid_plural "scissor jacks"
msgstr[0] "シザースジャッキ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'scissor jack'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "A compact scissor jack used for lifting vehicles."
msgstr "車両を持ち上げる際に使う、小型のシザースジャッキです。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "jackhammer"
msgid_plural "jackhammers"
msgstr[0] "ジャックハンマー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'jackhammer'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a construction tool for drilling through hard rock or other "
"surfaces.  It runs on gasoline.  Use it (if loaded) to blast a hole in "
"adjacent solid terrain."
msgstr "硬い岩や地面に穴をあけるための工事用ツールです。ガソリンで動きます。燃料がある状態で隣接する地形に対して使用すれば削岩できます。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "Auger"
msgid_plural "Augers"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Auger'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a construction tool for boring holes in ground.  It runs on "
"gasoline.  For health reasons alone, augers are a worthwhile investment."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "electric kiln"
msgid_plural "electric kilns"
msgstr[0] "電動窯"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'electric kiln'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a portable electric kiln, powered by batteries.  It is designed for "
"firing bricks, but you could use it to fire anything made of clay.  With a "
"little mechanical know-how, you could probably even convert it to run "
"directly off a vehicle's power system."
msgstr ""
"電池で作動する携帯型の電動窯です。レンガを焼成するためのものですが、粘土で作ったものを焼くこともできます。ちょっとした機械整備の知識があれば、車両電源で動くように改造できるかもしれません。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "gunsmith repair kit"
msgid_plural "gunsmith repair kits"
msgstr[0] "プロ用銃器修復キット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'gunsmith repair kit'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a complete toolkit made to repair damaged firearms, disassemble "
"ammunition and manufacture firearm modifications.  Powered by standard "
"batteries, it can tackle any armory work when coupled with a hand press.  It"
" requires 25 charges of battery power per use."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "makeshift hammer"
msgid_plural "makeshift hammers"
msgstr[0] "簡易ハンマー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'makeshift hammer'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a crude hammer made from a piece of metal affixed to a stick.  It "
"functions adequately as a hammer, but really can't compare to a proper one."
msgstr "棒に金属片を括りつけたハンマーの代用品です。ハンマーとしては十分に機能しますが、本物には遠く及びません。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "metal fileset"
msgid_plural "metal filesets"
msgstr[0] "ヤスリ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'metal fileset'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"These tools are commonly used to remove small amounts of materials from the "
"surface of metal objects."
msgstr "金属製の素材の表面を滑らかにする際に使う、一般的な工具です。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "metallic smoother"
msgid_plural "metallic smoothers"
msgstr[0] "左官ごて(金属)"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'metallic smoother'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This metallic tool is most often used to smooth concrete, or mortar, in "
"construction projects."
msgstr "建設現場でコンクリートやモルタルを平滑にする時に用いられます。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json data/mods/MagicalNights/items/tools.json
msgid "misc repair kit"
msgid_plural "misc repair kits"
msgstr[0] "多目的修復キット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'misc repair kit'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a portable toolkit, consisting of a small carving knife for precise "
"carving of replacement parts from raw materials, a wood saw for more heavy-"
"duty wood cutting, and a patch of soft material for cleaning surfaces.  If "
"supplied with duct tape, it can be used to repair certain items."
msgstr ""
"素材から精密な交換部品を削り出す小型カービングナイフ、硬い木材を切断するノコギリ、洗浄用の柔らかい布がセットになった持ち運びに便利なキットです。ダクトテープが付属していれば、特定のアイテムを修復できます。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json data/mods/MagicalNights/items/tools.json
msgid "makeshift repair kit"
msgid_plural "makeshift repair kits"
msgstr[0] "簡易修復キット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'makeshift repair kit'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a portable toolkit, consisting of a primitive knife for carving "
"replacement parts, an adze for more heavy-duty wood cutting, and a patch of "
"soft material for cleaning surfaces.  It can be used to repair certain items"
" if supplied with pitch, though it isn't ideal for complex work."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "plastic mold"
msgid_plural "plastic molds"
msgstr[0] "プラスチック用金型"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'plastic mold'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a plastic mold.  It could be shaped and used to craft items made of "
"plastic."
msgstr "プラスチック用の金型です。プラスチック製アイテムの製作や形状を整えるのに使います。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "multi-tool"
msgid_plural "multi-tools"
msgstr[0] "万能ツール"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'multi-tool'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"A cleverly designed all-in-one tool which combines several smaller tools "
"into the handles of a pair of pliers."
msgstr "持ち手の部分に小さな工具が複数収納されている、ペンチの形をした便利な工具です。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "acetylene torch"
msgid_plural "acetylene torches"
msgstr[0] "アセチレンバーナー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'acetylene torch', 'str_pl': 'acetylene torches'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"A compact tool kit intended for welding and cutting metal, this portable "
"oxyacetylene torch includes a torch handle and cutting attachment in an "
"easy-to-carry tote.  It requires connecting to pressurized cylinders of an "
"appropriate welding gas before use.  In addition to its metalworking uses, "
"you can activate it in order to destroy metal barriers."
msgstr ""
"持ち手と切断機アタッチメントがセットになった、金属溶接、切断作業に用いる持ち運びに便利な小型アセチレンバーナーです。使用するには、溶接用ガスが入った加圧シリンダーを用意する必要があります。金属加工だけでなく、金属製の壁を破壊する用途にも使えます。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "paint brush"
msgid_plural "paint brushes"
msgstr[0] "刷毛"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'paint brush', 'str_pl': 'paint brushes'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "A wide brush, suitable for painting walls."
msgstr "壁面を塗装するのに適した幅広のブラシです。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "pickaxe"
msgid_plural "pickaxes"
msgstr[0] "つるはし"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pickaxe'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a large steel pickaxe, suitable for breaking up hard things or (with"
" enough skill) hard targets.  Strike the earth!"
msgstr "鋼製の大きなつるはしです。硬い壁や(スキル次第では)硬い敵などの破壊に適しています。大地を削れ！"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "debugging prospecting pick"
msgid_plural "debugging prospecting picks"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'debugging prospecting pick'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a medium pickaxe-slash-hammer that could reveal close by ore "
"pockets. This one has an obscene range, for debugging. God save your CPU."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "crude prospecting pick"
msgid_plural "crude prospecting picks"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'crude prospecting pick'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a crude hammer-pick used for finding nearby mineral veins. Terrible "
"for anything you're not basically standing on."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "copper prospecting pick"
msgid_plural "copper prospecting picks"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for copper prospecting pick
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a copper hammer-pick used for finding nearby mineral veins. Not "
"accurate enough for long range, but works."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "steel prospecting pick"
msgid_plural "steel prospecting picks"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for steel prospecting pick
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a steel hammer-pick used for finding nearby mineral veins. Can help "
"you sniff out even faint traces of minerals."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "pin reamer"
msgid_plural "pin reamers"
msgstr[0] "ピンリーマー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pin reamer'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"Handheld pin reamers of this kind are used to enlarge existing holes, or "
"remove any burs and such from them."
msgstr "穴の径を広げたり形状を整えたりする際に使う、手持ち式の工具の一種です。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "pliers"
msgid_plural "pliers"
msgstr[0] "プライヤー"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'pliers'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a basic pair of slip-joint pliers, able to handle basic mechanical "
"work and pulling apart some ammunition cartridges.  Anything too complex "
"will require a wrench."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "electric polisher"
msgid_plural "electric polishers"
msgstr[0] "電動ポリッシャー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'electric polisher'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"An electric polisher which can be used to buff metal surfaces until they are"
" reflective like a mirror."
msgstr "研磨用の電動工具です。金属の表面に鏡のような反射加工を施します。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "stone hammer"
msgid_plural "stone hammers"
msgstr[0] "ハンマー(石)"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'stone hammer'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a rock affixed to a stick, in the crude facsimile of a hammer.  It "
"functions adequately as a hammer, but really can't compare to a proper one."
msgstr "棒に石を括り付けたハンマーの代用品です。ハンマーとしては十分に機能しますが、本物には遠く及びません。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "screwdriver"
msgid_plural "screwdrivers"
msgstr[0] "ドライバー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'screwdriver'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a Philips-head screwdriver.  It is important for almost all "
"electronics crafting, most mechanics crafting, and has many more uses."
msgstr "プラスドライバーです。大抵の電子機器や機械工作で重要な役割を果たし、他にも様々な用途があります。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "screwdriver set"
msgid_plural "screwdriver sets"
msgstr[0] "ドライバーセット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'screwdriver set'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a set of screwdrivers in several sizes and blade types.  Guaranteed "
"to have the right tools for more precise work."
msgstr "数種類のサイズと先端の形状が揃ったドライバーセットです。より精密な作業に適した工具が揃っています。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "firearm repair kit"
msgid_plural "firearm repair kits"
msgstr[0] "銃器修復キット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'firearm repair kit'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a portable toolkit made to repair damaged firearms.  Powered by "
"standard batteries, it is a vital tool for long-term firearms maintenance.  "
"It requires 100 charges of battery power per use."
msgstr ""
"損傷した銃器を修復するための専用工具が詰まった携帯式修復キットです。通常の電池で作動します。銃器を長く使うには必須のものと言えます。1回の使用で電池容量を100消費します。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "electric soldering iron"
msgid_plural "electric soldering irons"
msgstr[0] "電気はんだごて"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'electric soldering iron'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a device with a metal tip that can get very hot.  It is necessary "
"for advanced electronics crafting.  You could also use it to cauterize "
"wounds, if you had to."
msgstr "金属製の先端部が非常に熱くなる工具です。高度な電子工作に必須ですが、傷口の焼灼にも使えます。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "alcohol-fueled soldering iron"
msgid_plural "alcohol-fueled soldering irons"
msgstr[0] "アルコール燃料式はんだごて"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'alcohol-fueled soldering iron'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a device with a metal tip that can get very hot.  It is necessary "
"for advanced electronics crafting.  A metal tip is hold over the burner to "
"create enough heat to solder.  Not as sophisticated as a regular soldering "
"iron."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "toolbox"
msgid_plural "toolboxes"
msgstr[0] "工具箱"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'toolbox', 'str_pl': 'toolboxes'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a stout metal box containing a complete tool kit suitable for most "
"household maintenance and construction activities."
msgstr "頑丈な金属の箱に収められた完璧な工具セットです。一般家庭で想定されるほとんどの修繕･建築作業を可能とします。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "workshop toolbox"
msgid_plural "workshop toolboxes"
msgstr[0] "業務用工具箱"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'workshop toolbox', 'str_pl': 'workshop
#. toolboxes'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a stout metal box containing a complete tool kit suitable for most "
"household maintenance and construction activities, as well as additional "
"tools used in workshops for advanced fabrication jobs."
msgstr "一般家庭での大抵の修繕や建設作業に適したあらゆる工具に加え、工場などでの高度な製造作業に適した工具が収められた、頑丈な金属製の箱です。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "extended toolset"
msgid_plural "extended toolsets"
msgstr[0] "拡張工具セット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'extended toolset'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"Your toolset, protruding from your hands.  It can slice, dice, and make "
"everything nice."
msgstr "手と一体化した工具セットです。切断したり、さいの目に刻んだりと、様々な作業が可能です。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "arc welder"
msgid_plural "arc welders"
msgstr[0] "アーク溶接機"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'arc welder'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a battery powered tool for welding metal pieces together using an "
"electric arc.  It is an indispensable tool for construction or repair."
msgstr "アーク放電を利用して金属同士を溶接する、電池駆動の工具です。建設作業や修理には欠かせません。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "wooden smoother"
msgid_plural "wooden smoothers"
msgstr[0] "左官ごて(木)"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wooden smoother'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This large makeshift tool is used in smoothing concrete or mortar in "
"construction projects.  You could also use it as an improvised head-basher."
msgstr "この簡易ごては建設現場でコンクリートやモルタルを平滑にするときに使います。簡易的な鈍器として使用することもできます。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "wool staple"
msgid_plural "wool staples"
msgstr[0] "羊毛"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wool staple'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"The natural cluster of wool fibers.  Could be processed to the felt patches "
"or yarns."
msgstr "天然の羊毛の塊です。フェルトや糸に加工することができます。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "X-Acto knife"
msgid_plural "X-Acto knives"
msgstr[0] "アートナイフ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'X-Acto knife', 'str_pl': 'X-Acto knives'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a small, sharp knife, designed for making precise cuts for textiles "
"or crafts.  It could cause decent damage, but is difficult to hit things "
"with it.  Its small, sharp blade allows for precision strikes in the hands "
"of the skilled.  It is too small to butcher corpses with."
msgstr ""
"小型の鋭利な刃物です。織物や工作などの精密作業をするための道具ですが、傷の焼灼にも使えます。切れ味はまともですが、刃が小さ過ぎるため武器として使うのは困難です。死体の解体はできません。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "wrench"
msgid_plural "wrenches"
msgstr[0] "レンチ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wrench', 'str_pl': 'wrenches'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is an adjustable crescent wrench.  It could be a decent melee weapon, "
"and is used in many mechanics crafting recipes."
msgstr "サイズ調節が可能なレンチです。武器としても頼りになり、様々な機械工作で使われます。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "leather hose"
msgid_plural "leather hoses"
msgstr[0] "革製ホース"

#. ~ Description for leather hose
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a hose made out of leather.  Watertight and flexiable, it can be "
"used to siphon fuel from a vehicle tank.  However, it's not as elastic a "
"rubber hose."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
