msgid "Never mind, I'm not interested."
msgstr "いいや、興味ないね。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "You're not working on anything for me now."
msgstr "頼んでいる仕事は今のところ何もないよ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Which job?"
msgstr "どの依頼の話だ？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "What about it?"
msgstr "何だ？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "I'll do it!"
msgstr "やってみよう！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Not a problem."
msgstr "大丈夫だ、問題ない。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "Got any advice?"
msgstr "何か助言をもらえない？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Can you share some equipment?"
msgstr "少し持ち物を分けてくれないか？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
msgid "I'll be back soon!"
msgstr "すぐに戻ってくるよ！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
#: data/json/npcs/lumberyard/TALK_lumbermill_logger.json
msgid "Sounds good, thanks."
msgstr "分かった、ありがとう。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Sounds good.  Bye!"
msgstr "分かった、じゃあな！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I'm sorry."
msgstr "悪かった。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Whatever.  Bye."
msgstr "あっそう。じゃあね。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I'm sorry…  I failed."
msgstr "すまない...失敗してしまった。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Not yet."
msgstr "まだだ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I killed him."
msgstr "彼は殺したよ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I killed it."
msgstr "そいつは殺したよ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "No.  I'll get back to it, bye!"
msgstr "いいや、まだだ。さようなら。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Yup!  Here it is!"
msgstr "さあ、どうぞ！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "We're here!"
msgstr "着いたぞ！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Here I am."
msgstr "ここにいるよ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I talked to them."
msgstr "話してきたよ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Here it is!"
msgstr "あったよ！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Justice has been served."
msgstr "正義は成された。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I killed them.  All of them."
msgstr "すべて殺したよ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I brought 'em."
msgstr "持ってきた。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I've taken care of it"
msgstr "片付けてきた。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid ""
"I found it, but I'm keeping it, and I'll find you another one.  Let's talk "
"about something else."
msgstr "仕事は済んだけど、他に話したいことがある。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I found it, but I'm keeping it, and I'll find you another one.  Bye!"
msgstr "仕事は済んだけど、他にやっておきたいことがある。また後で！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Mission success!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Glad to help.  I need no payment."
msgstr "力になれたなら嬉しいよ。礼には及ばない。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "How about some items as payment?"
msgstr "品物で返してもらうというのはどうだろう？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Maybe you can teach me something as payment?"
msgstr "報酬として何かスキルを教えてもらえないかな？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Glad to help.  I need no payment.  Bye!"
msgstr "力になれたなら嬉しいよ。礼には及ばない。じゃあな！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Glad to help."
msgstr "役に立ててうれしいよ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Glad to help.  Bye!"
msgstr "役に立ててうれしいよ。じゃあね！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Well, um, sorry."
msgstr "ああ、うん、ごめん。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "I'm sorry.  I did what I could."
msgstr "すまない。出来るだけのことはしたんだ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Sure, here you go!"
msgstr "さあ、どうぞ！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_broker.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr "ありがとう。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Thanks, bye."
msgstr "ありがとう、じゃあね。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Well, I guess it's just us."
msgstr "さて、話をしようか。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "At least we've got shelter."
msgstr "シェルターはどうやら無事なようだね。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "What should we do now?"
msgstr "何をすればいいんだろう？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Any tips?"
msgstr "役立つ情報はある？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Want to travel with me?"
msgstr "一緒に旅をしないか？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Want to share some useful items with me?"
msgstr "役に立つアイテムを共有しないか？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json data/json/npcs/holdouts/Mr_Lapin.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "Well, bye."
msgstr "さようなら。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I don't know, look for supplies and other survivors I guess."
msgstr "うーん、分からないが...とりあえずは物資と生存者を探すといいんじゃないか？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Maybe we should start boarding up this place."
msgstr "そうだな、ドアや窓を板張りして外からの脅威に備える必要があるんじゃないだろうか。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid ""
"I suppose getting a car up and running should really be useful if we have to"
" disappear quickly from here."
msgstr "乗り物を手に入れるのがいいんじゃないか。何かあったとしてもすぐ逃げられるしね。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid ""
"We could look for one of those farms out here.  They can provide plenty of "
"food and aren't close to the cities."
msgstr "近くに農場が無いか探してみよう。街からもそれほど近くないだろうし、十分な食料もあるんじゃないかな。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid ""
"We should probably stay away from those cities, even if there's plenty of "
"useful stuff there."
msgstr "街に行けば役に立つ物が十分残っているだろうが、住む場所は街から離れていた方がいいと思う。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Hmm, okay."
msgstr "ふーん、分かった。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Thanks!"
msgstr "ありがとう！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Focus on the road, mate!"
msgstr "相棒、運転に集中してくれ！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I must focus on the road!"
msgstr "運転に集中させてくれ！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'm too thirsty, give me something to drink."
msgstr "すごく喉が渇いたよ。何か飲みたいな。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'm too hungry, give me something to eat."
msgstr "すごくお腹が空いたよ。何か食べたいな。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'm too tired, let me rest first."
msgstr "すごく疲れたよ。休ませてほしいな。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Nothing comes to my mind now.  Ask me later perhaps?"
msgstr "今は何も思いつかないな。後でまた聞いてくれる？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I have some reason for not telling you."
msgstr "ちょっと理由があって話せないんだ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Ah, okay."
msgstr "あぁ、分かった。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Not until I get some antibiotics..."
msgstr "抗生物質さえあれば..."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "You asked me recently; ask again later."
msgstr "さっき言ったはずだけど...またいつか誘ってくれよ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Why should I travel with you?"
msgstr "何故、君と一緒に旅をする必要があるんだ？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Understood.  I'll get those antibiotics."
msgstr "分かった。抗生物質を手に入れる。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Right, right, I'll ask later."
msgstr "ああ、そうだったね。また今度にするよ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I can keep you safe."
msgstr "君を護衛するよ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "You can keep me safe."
msgstr "君に護衛してほしいんだ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'll kill you if you don't."
msgstr "言う通りにしなければ殺す。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/cabin_chemist.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json src/iuse.cpp
msgid "Nevermind."
msgstr "なんでもない。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "You got it, I'm with you!"
msgstr "分かった、一緒に行くよ！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Awesome!"
msgstr "素晴らしい！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, let's go!"
msgstr "分かった、行こう！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Yeah… I don't think so."
msgstr "ああ...そうは思ってないよ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "何だい？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "How much further?"
msgstr "どれぐらい遠いんだ？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'd like to lead for a while."
msgstr "少しの間、リーダーをやるよ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Step aside.  I'm leader now."
msgstr "どいてろ。リーダーは私だ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Alright.  You can lead now."
msgstr "よし。君に付いて行くよ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Good.  Something else…"
msgstr "いいね。他には..."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Alright, let's go."
msgstr "よし、それじゃあ行こうか。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, okay."
msgstr "分かった、分かった。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Alright, let's begin."
msgstr "よろしい、始めよう。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Sounds good."
msgstr "いいね。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay.  Lead the way."
msgstr "よし。付いて行くよ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "No, we'll be okay here."
msgstr "いや、ここでいい。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "On second thought, never mind."
msgstr "ただの思い付きだ、気にしないでくれ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I can't train you properly while you're operating a vehicle!"
msgstr "車両を運転している間は、ちゃんと訓練できないよ！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I can't train you properly while I'm operating a vehicle!"
msgstr "車両を運転している間は、ちゃんと訓練できないよ！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Give it some time, I'll show you something new later..."
msgstr "少し時間をくれないか。後で話をしよう。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I have some reason for denying you training."
msgstr "ちょっと理由があって訓練はできないんだ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Not a bloody chance, I'm going to get left behind!"
msgstr "絶対に嫌だね、付いて行くからな！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_barber.json
msgid "Fine."
msgstr "よし。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'm on watch."
msgstr "ここで見張っているよ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I need you to come with me."
msgstr "一緒に来てくれ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "See you around."
msgstr "また今度にしよう。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I really don't feel comfortable doing so..."
msgstr "申し訳ないが、本当に嫌なんだ..."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'll give you some space."
msgstr "一定の距離を保つようにするよ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'd prefer to keep that to myself."
msgstr "自分について語りたくはないんだ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I understand…"
msgstr "そうか..."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "You just asked me for stuff; ask later."
msgstr "今はもう何もないんだ。また今度にしてくれ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Why should I share my equipment with you?"
msgstr "どうして持ち物をあげないといけないんだ？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid ""
"These aren't enough to finish the job, you want me to succeed, don't you…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, fine."
msgstr "そうだな、分かったよ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Because I'm holding a thermal detonator!"
msgstr "何故ならこっちはサーマルデトネーターを持っているからだ！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Because I'm your friend!"
msgstr "私達は友達だろう？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Well, I am helping you out…"
msgstr "頼みを聞いてあげたんだけど..."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'll give it back!"
msgstr "後で絶対返すからさ！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Give it to me, or else!"
msgstr "いいから早く渡せよ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json src/npctalk.cpp
msgid "Eh, never mind."
msgstr "あぁ、何でもない。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Never mind, I'll do without.  Bye."
msgstr "分かったよ、じゃあな。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, here you go."
msgstr "はい、どうぞ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Thank you!"
msgstr "ありがとう！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Thanks!  But can I have some more?"
msgstr "ありがとう！他に渡したい物は？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Thanks, see you later!"
msgstr "ありがとう、それじゃあまた！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "You picked up something that does not belong to you..."
msgstr "自分の所有物ではないものを拾ったな..."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, okay, this is all a misunderstanding.  Sorry, I'll drop it now."
msgstr "分かった、分かったよ、誤解があるようだ。悪かった、すぐに手放すよ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "No, I'm keeping it.  Try and take it off me, I dare you."
msgstr "嫌だね、貰っていくよ。取り返してみろ、出来るものならな。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Look, I really need this.  Please let me have it."
msgstr "なあ、本当にこれが必要なんだ。譲ってもらえないか。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "What, this?  It's not the same one, you are mistaken."
msgstr "何、これか？あなたの物ではないよ、勘違いしてるんだ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'm sorry.  Look, I already dropped it, okay?"
msgstr "悪かったよ。ほら、もう手放した、これでいいか？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Don't try and talk yourself out of this, drop it now."
msgstr "言い逃れは止めろ、早く落とすんだ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, I'm dropping it…"
msgstr "分かった、今手放すよ..."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Just this once, you can keep it.  Don't tell anyone else."
msgstr "それだけだ、持っていけ。誰にも言うなよ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/necropolis/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
#: data/json/npcs/prepper/TALK_NPC_prepper.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_shopkeep.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Thanks."
msgstr "ありがとう。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Right… I don't want any trouble."
msgstr "分かった...トラブルはごめんだ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Smart choice."
msgstr "賢い選択だ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "<no>."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, okay, sorry."
msgstr "分かった、分かった、すまなかったよ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, fine, bye."
msgstr "分かった、いいよ、じゃあな。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay"
msgstr "軽症"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid ""
"I'm willing to pay <topic_item_price> per batch for a total of "
"<topic_item_your_total_price>."
msgstr "1セットあたり<topic_item_price>だから、合計で<topic_item_your_total_price>支払おう。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Works for me."
msgstr "問題ない。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter1.json
msgid "Maybe later."
msgstr "また今度。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Pleasure doing business!"
msgstr "これからもよろしく頼むよ！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "You might be seeing more of me…"
msgstr "これからもよろしく..."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid "Hey again. *kzzz*"
msgstr "また会ったな。*ザザザザ*"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid ""
"I… I'm free. *Zzzt* I'm actually free! *bzzz* Look, you're the first person "
"I've seen in a long time."
msgstr "ワ...私は自由だ。*ザザザザ* 自由なんだ！*ブブブ* 久しぶりに人と会えたよ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Hey.  Let's chat for a second."
msgstr "やあ。少し話をしようか。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid "That's because I saved you.  Listen, I could use your help…"
msgstr "私が助けたお陰でね。なぁ、力になってもらえないかな..."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid ""
"Big fucking deal.  Do what I say or I'll shove that chip back where it "
"belongs."
msgstr "それは一大事だな。私の言う事を聞かないと、取り出したチップを元の場所に埋め戻すぞ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid "Sorry, I'm nobody.  Enjoy your freedom, I guess."
msgstr "失礼、私には関係ないことだ。存分に自由を満喫してくれ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid "*buzz* Great! So what happens now?"
msgstr "*ブブブ* もちろん！これからどうするんだ？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
msgid "Come with me.  We can help each other out."
msgstr "一緒に来てくれ。互いに助け合おう。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
msgid "We both go our separate ways.  Enjoy your freedom."
msgstr "これからは別々の道を歩もう。自由を満喫してくれ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid ""
"...Wait. *BEEP* Why do I believe you? *ZZZT* You could be just as bad as "
"them!"
msgstr "...なんだって。*ビィィィ* どうして君を信用したんだろうな？*ザザザザ* 奴らと同じくらい悪人じゃないか！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid ""
"I wouldn't have pulled your chip out if I didn't want you to think for "
"yourself."
msgstr "ただ言う事を聞かせたかっただけなら、チップを抜き取るなんて面倒なことはしなかったよ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
msgid ""
"For all you know, I did.  I'm being nice for now.  You'd better hope that it"
" lasts."
msgstr "ことによると、悪人かもな。今の所は優しくしてやっているんだから、大人しく従っておけ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
msgid "Forget it.  Enjoy your freedom."
msgstr "この話は忘れてくれ。自由を満喫するといい。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid ""
"Okay, okay, *BUZZ* I'm sorry! Don't hurt me again! Anything but the chip!"
msgstr "分かった、分かったよ、*ブブブブ* 悪かった！痛いのはもう嫌だ！チップを入れること以外なら何でもする！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
msgid "Follow me and do my bidding, then."
msgstr "では一緒に来い、命令に従え。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
msgid "Get out of my sight."
msgstr "私の視界から消えろ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
msgid "No, *I'm* sorry, I didn't mean that.  Go do what you want."
msgstr "いや、私が悪かった。そんなつもりじゃなかったんだ。これからは好きに生きればいい。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid "...kill… *ZTZTZT* …you!"
msgstr "...お前を...*ザザザザ*...殺す！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
msgid "Run while you still can!"
msgstr "足が動くうちに逃げるんだな！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
msgid "Not if I kill you first!"
msgstr "殺される前に殺してやる！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
msgid "I'm sorry!  I shouldn't have said that!"
msgstr "悪かった！酷いことを言ってしまった！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid "Yeah, *beeeeep* I don't think so.  Bye."
msgstr "ふぅん、*ビィィィィ* 本心とは思えないな。さようなら。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/talk_cyborg_abomination.json
msgid "Suit yourself."
msgstr "勝手にしろ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FRIEND_CONVERSATION.json
msgid ""
"Are you sure?  This doesn't seem like a particularly safe place for small "
"talk..."
msgstr "本気か？ここが下らない話ができるほど安全な場所だとは思えないな..."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FRIEND_CONVERSATION.json
msgid "It's fine, we've got a moment."
msgstr "問題ない、ちょっと話そう。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FRIEND_CONVERSATION.json
msgid "Good point, let's find a more appropriate place."
msgstr "そうだな、もう少し話しやすい場所に移ろう。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FRIEND_CONVERSATION.json
msgid "You're right.  Forget I said anything, let's get moving."
msgstr "確かにそうだ。さっき言ったことは忘れてくれ。さあ行こう。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FRIEND_CONVERSATION.json
msgid "What did you want to talk about?"
msgstr "何について話そうか？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_FRIEND_CONVERSATION.json
msgid "Actually, never mind."
msgstr "やっぱり何でもない。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "Yes, friend?"
msgstr "友よ、どうしました？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "Your travels be fruitful, friend."
msgstr "友よ、あなたの旅は実りあるものになりますよ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "May you find your peace, traveler."
msgstr "旅人よ、あなたの平穏をお祈りします。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "We might have lost everything, but hope remains."
msgstr "我々は全てを失ったのかもしれませんが、希望は残っています。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "May the earth flourish beneath our paths."
msgstr "我々の旅路のもとで、大地が繁栄しますように。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "Unity of spirit, of mind, and body..."
msgstr "魂、精神、そして肉体の統一..."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "Look for the bonds which define you, and act in accord."
msgstr "自己を定義する友を探し、共に行動しなさい。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid ""
"I don't know what kind of heresy you are spreading, but I'm putting an end "
"to it!"
msgstr "どんな異端の教えを広めているのか知らないが、私が終止符を打ってやる！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "This place is dangerous, what are you doing here?"
msgstr "ここは危険だ。何をしているんだ？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/cabin_chemist.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/cook.json data/json/npcs/godco/foodguard.json
#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_survivor.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyrus_whately.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/milly_whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/whately_generic_dialogue.json
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr "あなたは誰だ？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid ""
"Dangerous?  It may look different, but this land cares and provides for us."
"  We are celebrating with a feast, in fact.  Do you care to join us?"
msgstr "危険？あなたにはそう見えないかも知れませんが、この大地は我々を気遣い、養ってくれています。実際、我々は祝宴の最中です。あなたも参加しては？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "Well, sure."
msgstr "ええと、そうなんだ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "I'd… rather not."
msgstr "ちょっと...分からないな。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "I'm sorry…  I have places to be."
msgstr "失礼...もう行くよ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid ""
"I'm a priest or guide of a sort.  I sing the hymns along my companions so "
"that we may learn to live in unity, both with each other and with our ailing"
" world."
msgstr "私は司祭、案内人とも言えますね。調和して生きることを学べるように、仲間と共に賛歌を歌い広めています。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_broker.json
#: data/json/npcs/homeless/TALK_homeless_group_survivors.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_MERC_1.json
msgid "Alright."
msgstr "なるほど。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "Can I join you?"
msgstr "私も参加できるか？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "Understood.  Can I join you?"
msgstr "よく分かった。私も参加できるか？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "Well, I gotta go."
msgstr "ええと、そろそろ行くよ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "Oh, but you already have."
msgstr "おや、あなたは既に加わっていますよ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "Yes… yes I have."
msgstr "ああ...そうだった。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "Join us then, eat from this meal with us."
msgstr "どうぞ、我々と共にこの食事を摂るのです。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "[Take marloss berry] Thank you."
msgstr "[マーロスベリーを受け取った] ありがとう。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "I have changed my mind, thank you."
msgstr "悪いけど、気が変わった。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_MARLOSS_VOICE.json
msgid "I'm joining no stinking cult!  Take your berry and shove it!"
msgstr "こんなうさん臭いカルトに参加できるか！勝手に食ってくたばっちまえ！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgid "Are you one of them?"
msgstr "あんたは奴らの仲間なのか？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgid "One of who?"
msgstr "誰の仲間だって？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgid ""
"My thoughts exactly.  We have a lot in common, we should travel together!"
msgstr "あなたの仲間だよ。私たちは似た者同士だ。一緒に行こう！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgid "A daring trader?  Yes.  Let's trade items."
msgstr "斬新な商人だな？よし。物資の取り引きをしよう。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgid "I don't have time for this."
msgstr "今は時間が無いんだ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgid ""
"Hey, you're alive!  Me too.  Been a long while since I've had a "
"conversation.  Uh, with someone else.  Um."
msgstr "やあ、生きている人間だな！私もそうだ。久しぶりに会話ができたよ。ああ、独り言じゃない会話をね。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgid "It's not safe here anymore, you need to move on."
msgstr "ここはもう安全じゃない。移動するべきだ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgid "How did you make it?"
msgstr "どうやって生き残ったんだ？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid "What did you do before the Cataclysm?"
msgstr "大変動の前は何をしていたんだ？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Have anything to trade?"
msgstr "何か取り引きできる物はある？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgid ""
"I heard it's bad in the cities, back when the radio was still working.  Some"
" of those things came through here.  I want to stay out in the country if I "
"can stay safe."
msgstr "ラジオがまだ使えた頃の話だが、都会は酷いことになってると聞いたよ。ここを通って逃げて行った者もいる。安全に過ごせるなら田舎に留まりたいな。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgid ""
"One of the nice things about the country life is the troubles of the world "
"take a little longer to reach you, and some don't get you at all.  We didn't"
" see any dead the first day, but we heard all kinds of crazy things on the "
"news."
msgstr ""
"田舎暮らしの良い点は、世間の問題が私の所へやってくるまで時間がかかるか、もしくはまったく無関係で済むところだ。事が起きた初日はニュースでとんでもない事件ばかり聞いたが、ここでは死人ひとり見かけなかったよ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/hunter_2.json
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_1.json
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_2.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_2.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BGRS_migo_3.json
msgid "What happened next?"
msgstr "それからどうなったんだ？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgid ""
"Come a little closer, I don't want to make too much noise.  You smell much "
"nicer than what I'm used to.  Someone in trouble banged on the door that "
"night, she said she was desperate, she had a baby, her home had burned down "
"and her drugs were gone and there were monsters in the streets.  We figured "
"she was on drugs, but we couldn't turn them away so we gave them food and "
"let them stay in the barn."
msgstr ""
"もう少し近くへ来てくれ。あまり大声を出したくない。大丈夫、普段嗅いでる悪臭よりずっとマシだ。その日の夜にうちのドアを叩く奴がいた。その女は死に物狂いだった。妊娠してて、家が全焼して、薬も切れて、通りには怪物がいるなんて言い出すんだ。ヤク中かと思ったが追い返すこともできなかったから、食べ物を与えて、納屋に泊めてやった。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgid "That's decent, was she all right?"
msgstr "親切だな。その女性は助かったのか？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgid ""
"She was not all right.  I don't know what happened, if she was already "
"turning or if something got in and got her, but she and the baby didn't make"
" it.  We lost some more people trying to figure that out, it was horrible."
msgstr ""
"いや、ダメだった。彼女自身が既におかしくなってたのか、何かが侵入してきたのかも分からない。彼女とお腹の子は助からなかった。他にも何人か死んだ。恐ろしいことだ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgid "Are you all right?"
msgstr "あなたは大丈夫なのか？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgid ""
"I'm a lot better now, I've been hunkering down here.  Something came by in "
"the night screaming and crying, sounded just like that woman.  Maybe a "
"ghost, I don't know.  It's good to have company again.  You're not a ghost, "
"right?  On second thought, don't tell me if you are, I probably don't want "
"to know."
msgstr ""
"ここに閉じこもってたら、だいぶマシになってきたよ。夜中に何かが来て、あの女と同じような声で泣き叫んでたんだ。分からないが、幽霊だったのかな。人間が来てくれて本当に嬉しいよ。ええと、君は幽霊じゃないよな？いや、言わなくていい。答えを知りたくないからね。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json
msgid ""
"I grew up on the farm, I don't know much about ghosts and goblins,  but I've"
" spent a lot of time growing food and I work hard.  It's better in the "
"country, cleaner.  Not as dangerous.  I hope."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid "Hey, I didn't expect to live long enough to see another living human!"
msgstr "やあ、私の他にも長く生き延びている人間がいるとはな！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid "I've been here since shit went down.  Just my luck I had to work."
msgstr "世界がめちゃくちゃになってからは、ずっとここにいた。まったく、こんな時も仕事とはね。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid "How are you alive?"
msgstr "どうやって生き残ったんだ？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid ""
"Well, the dishwasher made a break for it three days after things got weird."
"  He was ripped to shreds before he made it to the street.  I figure this "
"place has gotta be safer than my apartment, and at least I've got all this "
"food here."
msgstr ""
"そうだな、外が騒がしくなってから3日後、洗い場担当がここから逃げ出した。大通りに出る間もなく、彼は細切れにされたよ。この場所は自宅のアパートよりは安全だ。少なくとも食べ物はたっぷりあるからね。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid ""
"I… um… hid.  I was in the kitchen, preparing another masterpiece when I "
"heard glass shattering followed by screaming.  I ran over to the serving "
"window to see what happened, assuming a guest had fallen and broke "
"something.  What I witnessed was the most awful thing I've ever seen.  I'm "
"not even sure I could go over it again."
msgstr ""
"ああ...それは...隠れていたんだ。厨房で傑作の料理を作っていると、ガラスが割れる音と叫び声が聞こえた。てっきり客が転んで何かを落としたのかと思って、配膳口から覗き込んだ。そこから見えたのは今までで一番酷い光景さ。もう一度見たら正気を失くすかもしれないな。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid ""
"Some lunatic covered in a film of goo, black as oil, had fallen through one "
"of the large glass windows.  There were glass shards stuck in its head and "
"neck.  I thought the poor guy, girl-thing-whatever was dead.  People began "
"to crowd around it, some were taking pictures."
msgstr ""
"重油のように黒い粘液で覆われた狂人達が、大きなガラス窓を突き破って入ってきた。頭や首にガラス片が突き刺さったままだ。男か女かもはっきりしない気の毒なそいつは、まるで死体だった。周囲の人も騒ぎ始めていて、写真を撮ってる奴もいた。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid "Horrible.  Did you get any pictures yourself?"
msgstr "恐ろしいな。あなたは写真を撮ったのか？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid ""
"No!  I figured the thing dead until it started writhing and spazzing out for"
" a moment.  Everyone jumped back, a few screamed, and one curious stranger "
"stepped in closer, kneeling a little… it attacked him!"
msgstr ""
"まさか！そいつは事切れたと思ったら、急にジタバタと暴れ出した。皆驚いて、叫び声を上げているのもいたが、好奇心の強い誰かが近づいて屈んでみると...そいつが攻撃してきたんだ！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid "What'd you do?"
msgstr "それからどうしたんだ？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid ""
"I ran to the back of the kitchen and hid as best I could.  People outside "
"were screaming and I could hear them running.  Suddenly I heard more glass "
"shatter and something skitter out of the restaurant.  I waited a moment and "
"then went and checked the dining area.  Both the stranger and the thing were"
" gone.  People were running in the streets, some even had guns so I locked "
"all the doors and blocked the windows with what I could and barricaded "
"myself in here."
msgstr ""
"私は厨房へ逃げ帰り、じっと隠れていた。外からは、人々の悲鳴と逃げ惑う音が聞こえてきた。すると突然さっきよりたくさんのガラスが割れる音が響き、何かがレストランから飛び出していった。しばらく待ってからホールを見に行ったよ。乱入者も含めて、誰一人いなかった。通りには逃げる人や銃を持ってる奴もいたから、全てのドアに鍵をかけ、窓を塞ぎ、バリケードを作った。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid "Crazy, so you have been here ever since?"
msgstr "なんてことだ、それ以来ずっとここにいるのか？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, it was awhile before it was quiet again.  I heard all kinds of sounds:"
" explosions, jets flying by, helicopters, screaming, and rapid gunfire.  I "
"swear I even heard what sounded like a freaking tank drive by at one time!  "
"I've been hiding here since."
msgstr ""
"ああ、辺りが静かになるまでしばらく時間がかかった。爆発、ジェット機やヘリの騒音、叫び声、轟く銃声...色々な音が聞こえた。今までに聞いたことの無いような、戦車のような奇妙な音すらしていた！それからはずっと隠れて過ごしたよ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid ""
"I've been a cook since forever, this wasn't the best joint, but management "
"was cool."
msgstr "料理人一筋さ。最高の職場とは言えないけど、経営は上手くいっていた。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Greetings friend, it's nice to see you."
msgstr "やあ、友よ。会えて嬉しいよ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "So you're back… Explain yourself!"
msgstr "戻ってきたな...説明してもらおうか！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "What sorcery is this?"
msgstr "これはどんな魔法なんだ？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Welcome home Foodkid!"
msgstr "おかえりなさい、フードキッド！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Still here?  Take your time, it's rough out there."
msgstr "まだいたの？ごゆっくり。外は危ないからね。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Greeting citizen, what brings you to the FoodLair?"
msgstr "ごきげんよう、どうやってフードパーソンの隠れ家にたどり着いたのかな？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Greetings…  Foodperson?"
msgstr "どうも...フードパーソン？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "I am you but from an alternate reality."
msgstr "私は別の世界からやってきたあなただ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "I am Foodperson, who are YOU?"
msgstr "私はフードパーソン。あなたは誰？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "There is only one real Foodperson!"
msgstr "真のフードパーソンは常に一人！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "I am the REAL Foodperson!"
msgstr "私こそが真のフードパーソンだ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Nevermind me, I'm just going to leave."
msgstr "私のことは気にしないで。もう行くよ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Indeed it is I! The one and only FOODPERSON!"
msgstr "確かに私だ！唯一無二のフードパーソン！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Wow!  Such an honor to meet you in person!"
msgstr "わぁ！実際にお会いできるなんて光栄です！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Are you joking?  Foodperson is not real, it's a restaurant mascot!"
msgstr "何の冗談だ？フードパーソンは単なるレストランのマスコットだろ！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid ""
"The great Foodperson in the flesh!  Such an honor to finally meet you in "
"person!"
msgstr "フードパーソンが目の前に！お会いできて光栄です！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Ah…  Well, nice to meet you Foodperson."
msgstr "ええと...その、どうぞよろしく、フードパーソン。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Do not mock me, for my strength is quite real!  Get out of here now!"
msgstr "からかうのは止めろ。私の強さは常に現実だ。今すぐ出て行け！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Sheesh, ok, calm down, I'm leaving!"
msgstr "おいおい、分かった、落ち着きなよ、もう行くから！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Forgive me, I didn't mean to disrespect you."
msgstr "許してくれ、バカにするつもりじゃなかったんだ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Oh yeah?  Show me what you can do!"
msgstr "何だって？やれるもんならやってみな！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "A common mistake, but I can assure you that I'm very real!"
msgstr "よくある間違いだが、私こそが本物だということを証明してやってもいい！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Sure, whatever."
msgstr "へぇ、そう。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Ok…  I believe you."
msgstr "わかった...信じるよ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Anyway, do you need something?"
msgstr "ところで、何か欲しいものはある？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Are you interested in some trading?"
msgstr "取り引きがしたいのか？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Let's trade?"
msgstr "取り引きしようか？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "I'm looking for a place to stay."
msgstr "休める場所を探しているんだ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "I want to get stronger.  Please teach me."
msgstr "強くなりたいんだ。指南してくれ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Please share your knowledge."
msgstr "知識を共有したいんだ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "I'm building up a team, people with special abilities."
msgstr "高い技能を持った人を集めて、チームを作っているんだ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Can you tell me again about this sidekick offer?"
msgstr "助手を募集してるって話を、もう一度説明してくれないか？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Alright, I thought about this, what do you say about we team up?"
msgstr "よし、良いことを考えた。私たちでチームを組まないか？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "I'm good, bye."
msgstr "分かった、また今度。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "I already have everything I need here in the FoodLair!"
msgstr "フードパーソンの隠れ家には必要なものが全て揃っているよ！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Alright let's see what you've got."
msgstr "何を持っているのか見せてもらおう。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "You're not ready for this."
msgstr "まだその時ではない。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "But I am worthy!"
msgstr "そんな事はないと思うけどなぁ！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "I can teach you a few tricks."
msgstr "秘訣を教えてあげよう。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "This is no place for a civilian.  You should go to the refugee center."
msgstr "ここは民間人のための施設じゃない。避難センターへ行くべきだな。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Damn!"
msgstr "畜生！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Well…  You seem like a decent sort, I might have an offer for you."
msgstr "そうだな...君はまともな奴のようだ。少し手伝ってもらおうかな。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Sorry but I work alone."
msgstr "悪いけど、一人で行動したいんだ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "We could really use your help!"
msgstr "手伝ってもらえると助かるんだけどなぁ！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "What about: you prove your worth and join me as my sidekick?"
msgstr "自分の価値を証明し、私の助手になってくれるのか？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "That sounds great!"
msgstr "やってみよう！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Ok…"
msgstr "オーケー..."

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "I need to think about it."
msgstr "考えさせてほしい。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Huh…  No thanks."
msgstr "うーん...結構だ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "There's other things I'd like to discuss."
msgstr "他にも話したいことがあるんだ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Alright bye."
msgstr "じゃあ、また今度。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "The way you talk, the way you move…  You're…  You're me?  But how?"
msgstr "君の話し方、そして動作...君は...君は私なのか？どういうこと？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid ""
"I…  I don't know.  It probably has something to do with <the_cataclysm>!  "
"What do you say we team up to find out?"
msgstr "わ...分からない。きっと<the_cataclysm>と関係があるはずだ！いっそチームを組んでみようか？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid ""
"It might have something to do with <the_cataclysm>, mind if I stay here "
"while we try to figure this out?"
msgstr "<the_cataclysm>と関係があるのだろうか。考えがまとまるまでここに居ても構わない？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "This can't be true, you're trying to trick me!"
msgstr "こんなのデタラメだ。私を騙そうとしているな！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "I need time to think."
msgstr "考えさせてほしい。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Wha…  But.  But…  How?"
msgstr "わ...えっ、えっ...何？"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid ""
"No time to explain, the world is at an end and we must join forces to save "
"it!"
msgstr "説明してる暇はない。世界は滅びかけていて、力を合わせて救わなければならないんだ！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid ""
"The Cataclysm weakened the space-time continuum, I accidentally fell through"
" a tear in reality and ended up here.  I will need access to your resources "
"to keep fighting."
msgstr "大変動が時空の連続性を歪めたことで、次元の裂け目に偶然落ちてしまい、ここに辿り付いたんだ。戦い続けるには君の力が必要だ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid ""
"I am the ultimate Foodperson, I travel the multiverse consuming powers from "
"all the Foodpersons.  And now I've come for you!"
msgstr ""
"私はアルティメット・フードパーソン。あらゆる世界に遍在するフードパーソンの力を借りて、多元宇宙を旅しているんだ。そして今、君の下にやってきた！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Can't tell you now.  In due time all will be revealed."
msgstr "今は話せない。やがて全てが明らかになるだろう。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Of course, whatever you need…  Foodperson."
msgstr "もちろん。フードパーソン、必要なものがあれば言ってくれ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Thank you Foodperson!  It's good to know I have a friend here."
msgstr "ありがとうフードパーソン！仲間がいると分かって嬉しいよ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid ""
"It's crazy out there, it's going to be a tough journey but I'm with you!"
msgstr "外は大変な騒ぎだ。厳しい旅になるだろうが、一緒にがんばろう！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Let's go, we have a world to save!"
msgstr "さあ、世界を救いに行こう！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "There can be only one!"
msgstr "私一人で十分だ！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "I AM THE ONE!"
msgstr "私は唯一無二だ！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "Wow calm down, it's just a prank bro."
msgstr "ちょっと落ち着けよ、ただの冗談だ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "WAIT!  There might be another way!"
msgstr "待て！もっと良いやり方があるはずだ！"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
msgid "I don't want to fight you.  I'm leaving."
msgstr "あなたと戦うつもりはない。もう行くよ。"

