#: data/json/obsoletion/flags.json
msgid "This item provides comfort during sleep."
msgstr "このアイテムは快適な睡眠をもたらします。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "leaf spring"
msgid_plural "leaf springs"
msgstr[0] "板バネ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'leaf spring'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A large, heavy-duty leaf spring.  Probably from some car or truck, and looks"
" an awful lot like a bow.  You can barely bend it…"
msgstr "大きく頑丈な板バネです。恐らく車やトラックに装着されていたもので、弓がたくさん重なったような形状です。硬くてほとんど曲がりません..."

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "makeshift grenade"
msgid_plural "makeshift grenades"
msgstr[0] "簡易手榴弾"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'makeshift grenade'}.
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "You pull the pin on the makeshift grenade."
msgstr "簡易手榴弾のピンを引き抜きました。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'makeshift grenade'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"An improvised explosive device cobbled together from parts.  Use this item "
"to pull the pin and light the fuse.  You will then have about 5 seconds "
"before it explodes; throwing it would be a good idea."
msgstr "様々な部品を組み合わせて作った、即席の爆発装置です。使用するとピンを引いて起動し、約5秒後に爆発します。爆発する前に投げましょう。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "active makeshift grenade"
msgid_plural "active makeshift grenades"
msgstr[0] "簡易手榴弾(起動)"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "barrel extension"
msgid_plural "barrel extensions"
msgstr[0] "ロングバレル"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A longer barrel increases the muzzle velocity of a firearm, contributing to "
"both accuracy and damage but reduces portability and slows aiming."
msgstr "銃身を延長すると銃口速度が上がるため、命中精度とダメージが増加します。その一方で携帯性は損なわれ、照準を合わせるのが遅くなります。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "rifled barrel"
msgid_plural "rifled barrels"
msgstr[0] "ライフルバレル"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"Rifling a shotgun barrel is mainly done in order to improve its accuracy "
"when firing slugs.  The rifling makes the gun less suitable for shot, "
"however."
msgstr "ショットガンの銃身にライフリングを刻むことで単発弾の精度を向上させます。ショットガンらしくないと言えばらしくない改造ですけど、ね。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "rapid blowback"
msgid_plural "rapid blowbacks"
msgstr[0] "高速排莢機構"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"An improved blowback mechanism makes your firearm's automatic fire faster, "
"at the cost of reduced accuracy and increased noise."
msgstr "連射速度を上げる改良型の排莢機構です。精度が下がり、発射音が増加します。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "auto-fire mechanism"
msgid_plural "auto-fire mechanisms"
msgstr[0] "自動発射機構"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A simple mechanism that converts a pistol to a selective fire weapon with a "
"burst size of three rounds.  However it reduces accuracy and increases "
"noise."
msgstr "ピストルに3連射可能なセレクティブ・ファイア機構を追加する単純な構造の部品です。命中精度が下がり、発射音が大きくなります。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ".22 caliber conversion kit"
msgid_plural ".22 caliber conversion kits"
msgstr[0] "変換キット(.22口径)"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"Replacing several key parts of a 9x19mm, .38, .40, 5.7mm, 4.6mm, 7.62x39mm "
"or .223 firearm converts it to a .22 firearm.  The conversion results in a "
"slight reduction to accuracy."
msgstr ""
"9x19mm、.38口径、.40口径、5.7mm、4.6mm、7.62x39mm、.223口径の銃を.22口径弾対応に変換する部品です。変換するとわずかに精度が下がります。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "7.62x51mm caliber conversion kit"
msgid_plural "7.62x51mm caliber conversion kits"
msgstr[0] "変換キット(7.62x51mm)"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"This kit is used to convert a shotgun or 7.62x39mm, .223 or .30-06 rifle to "
"the popular and powerful 7.62x51mm caliber.  The conversion results in "
"reduced ammo capacity and a slight reduction to accuracy."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ".45 caliber conversion kit"
msgid_plural ".45 caliber conversion kits"
msgstr[0] "変換キット(.45口径)"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"Replacing several key parts of a 9x19mm, .38, .40 or .44 firearm converts it"
" to a .45 firearm.  The conversion results in a slight reduction to "
"accuracy."
msgstr "9x19mm、.38口径、.40口径、.44口径の銃を.45口径弾対応に変換する部品です。変換するとわずかに精度が下がります。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "4.6mm caliber conversion kit"
msgid_plural "4.6mm caliber conversion kits"
msgstr[0] "変換キット(4.6mm)"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A conversion kit produced by Heckler and Koch, used to convert .22, 9x19mm, "
"or .38 firearms to their proprietary 4.6x30mm, a round designed for accuracy"
" and armor penetration."
msgstr ".22口径、9x19mm、.38口径の銃を、精度と装甲貫通力を重視した4.6x30mm弾対応に変換するH&K社製の部品一式です。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "5.7mm caliber conversion kit"
msgid_plural "5.7mm caliber conversion kits"
msgstr[0] "変換キット(5.7mm)"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A conversion kit produced by FN Herstal, used to convert .22, 9x19mm, or .38"
" firearms to their proprietary 5.7x28mm, a round designed for accuracy and "
"armor penetration."
msgstr ""
".22口径、9x19mm、.38口径の銃を、精度と装甲貫通力を重視した自社規格5.7x28弾対応に変換する、FN Herstal社製の部品一式です。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "9x19mm caliber conversion kit"
msgid_plural "9x19mm caliber conversion kits"
msgstr[0] "変換キット(9x19mm)"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"Replacing several key parts of a 9x18mm, .38, .40, .44 or .45 firearm "
"converts it to a 9x19mm firearm.  The conversion results in a slight "
"reduction to accuracy."
msgstr ""
"9x18mm、.38口径、.40口径、.44口径、.45口径の銃を9x19mm弾対応に変換する部品です。変換するとわずかに精度が下がります。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "belt feed adapter"
msgid_plural "belt feed adapters"
msgstr[0] "弾帯アダプタ"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A kit providing the necessary parts for permanently converting a firearm "
"from magazine to belt-feed.  Guaranteed to void your warranty."
msgstr "銃器の弾薬補給を弾倉式から弾帯式に不可逆的改造を加えるための部品一式です。銃器が保証対象外になることは保証できます。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
#: data/mods/exotic_ammo/items/gunmod/magazine.json
msgid "magazine"
msgstr "弾倉"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
