#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
msgid "Wind Turbine CBM"
msgid_plural "Wind Turbine CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 風力タービン"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Wind Turbine CBM'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Wind Turbines'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Installed on your body is a set of small retractable wind turbines.  When "
"activated, they will deploy and slowly harvest wind power to recharge your "
"power level."
msgstr "胴体に小型の風力タービンが格納されています。起動すると風車を展開し、CBM用の電力をゆっくりと発電します。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid "Cranium Bomb"
msgid_plural "Cranium Bombs"
msgstr[0] "頭蓋爆弾"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Cranium Bomb'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
msgid ""
"A bomb installed where your spine meets your brain stem.  It's on a timer "
"from installation and you don't have the codes to reset the timer."
msgstr "背骨と脳幹の間に移植された爆弾です。タイマーが付いていますが、リセットするコードはありません。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid "Skullgun CBM"
msgid_plural "Skullgun CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: スカルガン"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Skullgun CBM'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Concealed in your head is a single shot .40 pistol.  Activate the bionic to "
"fire and reload the skullgun."
msgstr "頭部に.40口径の単発銃を埋め込みます。起動することで射撃したり装填したりできます。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid "nutriment"
msgid_plural "nutriments"
msgstr[0] "栄養剤"

#. ~ Description for nutriment
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid ""
"A crumbly white pill half the size of your thumb, packed with vitamins and "
"calories.  Provides a whole day's nutrition in portable form, but it's a "
"little hard to keep down, thanks to the rancid taste and chalky texture."
msgstr ""
"ビタミンとカロリーが詰まった、親指ほどの大きさの脆い錠剤です。丸一日分の栄養をこれ一個で補えますが、酸っぱい味と粉っぽい食感に思わず吐き出したくなります。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid "nutriment water"
msgid_plural "nutriment waters"
msgstr[0] "栄養剤ドリンク"

#. ~ Description for nutriment water
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid ""
"Nutriment that has been dissolved in water to dilute its taste.  Unnervingly"
" resembles spoiled milk."
msgstr "水に溶かして味を薄めた栄養剤です。腐った牛乳の味に驚くほどよく似ています。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles.json
msgid "sundew"
msgid_plural "sundews"
msgstr[0] "サンデュー"

#. ~ Description for sundew
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles.json
msgid ""
"Water treated with some sort of chemical compound.  It's incapable of "
"freezing, is very light, and glows faintly.  Drinking it seems to sharpen "
"the senses."
msgstr "ある種の化合物で処理した水です。決して凍らず、カロリーが少なく、ほのかに光ります。この水を飲むと感覚が鋭くなるようです。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/comestibles.json
msgid "sungel"
msgid_plural "sungels"
msgstr[0] "サンジェル"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for sungel.
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/comestibles.json
msgid ""
"Your vision sharpens and your eyes widen as the sungel slams your senses."
msgstr "視力が向上し、視界が広がりました。"

#. ~ Description for sungel
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/comestibles.json
msgid ""
"Mixed with morphine, this sundew has congealed, and has an immense "
"stimulative and pain-numbing effect.  With sufficient tools, it could be "
"used to create anesthesia."
msgstr "強い興奮剤と鎮痛剤の効果をもつ、不凍水とモルヒネを混合したゼリーです。適切な道具があれば、これを材料に麻酔薬を製作できます。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/obsolete.json
msgid "sunesthesia"
msgid_plural "sunesthesias"
msgstr[0] "サンエステシア"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for sunesthesia.
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/obsolete.json
msgid "You go limp and collapse as the sunesthesia knocks you senseless."
msgstr "サンエステシアが体内に回ると同時に身体の力が抜け、意識が途切れました。"

#. ~ Description for sunesthesia
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"This sungel has been mixed with several drugs and yet inherits none of their"
" effects.  Its painkilling effect hasn't changed, but its stimulative "
"properties have been reversed, and it could be used as anesthesia for "
"installation of bionics."
msgstr ""
"サンジェルと何種類かの薬品を混合した溶液ですが、元の薬品の効果はまったく残っていません。鎮痛作用は依然としてありますが、興奮ではなく鎮静作用をもっています。CBMを移植する際の麻酔薬として利用できます。"

