msgstr "C.R.I.T.ナイフ術"

#. ~ Description for martial art 'C.R.I.T Blade-work'
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_Bladework.json
msgid ""
"An offensive style that is centered around rapid slashes and prodding.  Each"
