msgstr "C.R.I.T.の近接攻撃術について記した高度な軍用マニュアルです。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_EnforcementBuff.json
msgid "C.R.I.T Enforcement"
msgstr "C.R.I.T.執行官戦闘術"

#. ~ Description for martial art 'C.R.I.T Enforcement'
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_EnforcementBuff.json
msgid ""
"A defensive style that is centered around stunning swings, knockback and "
"grounding enemies.  Each attack landed increases your armor by 0.125 and "
"offers other combat bonuses based on stats."
msgstr ""
"周囲の敵に対して気絶、吹き飛ばし、転倒効果をもつ防御的な戦闘スタイルです。命中する度に防御力が0.125増加し、その他の戦闘ボーナス効果が付与されます。"

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art 'C.R.I.T Enforcement'
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_EnforcementBuff.json
msgid "You ready yourself to stand your ground."
msgstr "覚悟を決めました。"

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art 'C.R.I.T Enforcement'
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_EnforcementBuff.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s draws a line in the sand."
msgstr "%sは地面に一線を引き、戦線を定めました。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_EnforcementBuff.json
msgid "C.R.I.T Buildup"
msgstr "C.R.I.T.増強"

#. ~ Description of buff 'C.R.I.T Buildup' for martial art 'C.R.I.T
#. Enforcement'
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_EnforcementBuff.json
msgid "+0.05 armor and other small bonuses per stack.  Max of 10 stacks"
msgstr "防御力+0.05、その他ボーナス効果蓄積。最大蓄積数10。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_EnforcementBuff.json
msgid "C.R.I.T Guard"
msgstr "C.R.I.T.防御"

#. ~ Description of buff 'C.R.I.T Guard' for martial art 'C.R.I.T Enforcement'
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_EnforcementBuff.json
msgid "+1 armor.  STR provides accuracy and minor bash arpen."
msgstr "防御力+1。筋力に対応した命中精度、打撃与ダメージ、貫通力の向上。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/martial/CRT_EnforcementBuff.json
