#: data/mods/CheesyInnaWoodsFixes/modinfo.json
msgid "CheesyInnaWoodFixes"
msgstr "CheesyInnaWoodFixes"

#. ~ Description for CheesyInnaWoodFixes
#: data/mods/CheesyInnaWoodsFixes/modinfo.json
msgid ""
"CheesyInnaWoodFixes ports CDDA innawoods content and makes industrial age "
"possible."
msgstr "CheesyInnaWoodFixes は CDDA の innawoods コンテンツを移植し、産業時代を可能にします。"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'brass'}
#: data/mods/CheesyInnaWoodsFixes/items/ammo_casing.json
msgid ""
"An alloy of 70% copper and 30% zinc, useful for creating bullet casings."
msgstr "銅70％、亜鉛30％の合金で、薬莢を作るのに便利です。"

#: data/mods/CheesyInnaWoodsFixes/items/chems.json
msgid "latex"
msgid_plural "latex"
msgstr[0] "ラテックス"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'latex'}
#: data/mods/CheesyInnaWoodsFixes/items/chems.json
msgid "A liquid precursor to rubber found in some plants."
msgstr "ある種の植物が分泌するゴムの前駆体です。"

#: data/mods/CheesyInnaWoodsFixes/items/chems.json
msgid "formic acid"
msgid_plural "formic acid"
msgstr[0] "ギ酸"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'formic acid'}
#: data/mods/CheesyInnaWoodsFixes/items/chems.json
msgid ""
"Common in nature as an insect venom, this substance has a number of "
"industrial uses such as preservation and manufacturing."
msgstr "この物質は自然界の昆虫毒で、防腐処理や製造業など、様々な産業用途をもっています。"

#: data/mods/CheesyInnaWoodsFixes/items/chems.json
msgid "birchbark bandage"
msgid_plural "birchbark bandages"
msgstr[0] "シラカバ包帯"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'birchbark bandage'}
#: data/mods/CheesyInnaWoodsFixes/items/chems.json
msgid ""
"A small roll of birchbark with cord, to tie around wounds to help stop "
"bleeding and protect from dirt.  It's better than nothing."
msgstr ""
"シラカバの樹皮を小さく丸めたものに紐を付けただけの包帯です。傷口を覆って止血や保護に使いますが、何もしないよりはマシ程度の効果しかありません。"

#: data/mods/CheesyInnaWoodsFixes/items/chems.json
msgid "salved birchbark bandage"
msgid_plural "salved birchbark bandages"
msgstr[0] "軟膏付きシラカバ包帯"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'salved birchbark bandage'}
#: data/mods/CheesyInnaWoodsFixes/items/chems.json
msgid ""
"Birchbark bandages with added garlic salve.  They're better for wounds but "
"not as good as real bandages."
msgstr "ニンニクの軟膏を塗ったシラカバ包帯です。傷口の保護に役立ちますが、本物の包帯には劣ります。"

#: data/mods/CheesyInnaWoodsFixes/items/electronics_bn.json
msgid "makeshift transformer"
msgid_plural "makeshift transformers"
msgstr[0] "簡易変圧器"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'makeshift transformer'}
#: data/mods/CheesyInnaWoodsFixes/items/electronics_bn.json
msgid ""
"A bundle of cables around an iron core.  Useful for controlling voltage."
msgstr "ケーブルを巻いた鉄芯です。電圧を制御するのに役立ちます。"

#: data/mods/CheesyInnaWoodsFixes/items/misc_bn.json
msgid "light battery shell"
msgid_plural "light battery shells"
msgstr[0] "電池外装(小型)"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'light battery shell'}
#: data/mods/CheesyInnaWoodsFixes/items/misc_bn.json
msgid ""
"This is the outer casing of a light battery.  It will need to be refilled to"
" be useful."
msgstr "小型電池の外装です。電池の製作材料として役立ちます。"

#: data/mods/CheesyInnaWoodsFixes/items/misc_bn.json
msgid "medium battery shell"
msgid_plural "medium battery shells"
msgstr[0] "電池外装(中型)"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'medium battery shell'}
#: data/mods/CheesyInnaWoodsFixes/items/misc_bn.json
msgid ""
"This is the outer casing of a medium battery.  It will need to be refilled "
"to be useful."
msgstr "中型電池の外装です。電池の製作材料として役立ちます。"

#: data/mods/CheesyInnaWoodsFixes/items/misc_bn.json
msgid "heavy battery shell"
msgid_plural "heavy battery shells"
msgstr[0] "電池外装(大型)"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'heavy battery shell'}
#: data/mods/CheesyInnaWoodsFixes/items/misc_bn.json
msgid ""
"This is the outer casing of a heavy battery.  It will need to be refilled to"
" be useful."
msgstr "大型電池の外装です。電池の製作材料として役立ちます。"

#: data/mods/Civilians/civilians.json
msgid "panicked person"
msgid_plural "panicked persons"
msgstr[0] "慌てふためく人"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'panicked person'}
#: data/mods/Civilians/civilians.json
msgid ""
"This hysterical individual has a faint, yet fading, glint of intelligence in"
" their bloodshot eyes.  They sometimes scream in fear and behave clearly "
"irrationally.  This will quite likely cause their demise at the hands of the"
" undead horde rather quickly."
msgstr ""
"ひどく取り乱したこの人物の血走った目には、消えつつある知性の光がかすかに残っています。時折恐怖のあまり叫び出すなど、明らかにおかしな振る舞いをしているので、不死者の群れによってすぐに最期を迎えるでしょう。"

#: data/mods/Civilians/civilians.json
msgid "petrified person"
msgid_plural "petrified persons"
msgstr[0] "呆然とする人"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'petrified person'}
#: data/mods/Civilians/civilians.json
msgid ""
"They just stand there, staring into the void, with a vacant expression on "
"their face.  Barely moving, they will probably fall to the undead horde "
"soon."
msgstr "うつろな表情で宙を見つめながら立ち尽くしています。ほとんど動かないので不死者の群れにすぐに倒されるでしょう。"

#: data/mods/Civilians/civilians.json
msgid "overconfident officer"
msgid_plural "overconfident officers"
msgstr[0] "思い上がった警官"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'overconfident officer'}
#: data/mods/Civilians/civilians.json
msgid ""
"Gun in hand, this police officer is determined to make a last stand against "
"the horde."
msgstr "銃を手にしたこの警察官は、大群に最後まで立ち向かおうと固く決意しています。"

#: data/mods/Civilians/civilians.json
msgid "The officer fires their Glock 22!"
msgstr "警官はグロック22を発砲しました!"

#: data/mods/Civilians/civilians.json
msgid "futile fighter"
msgid_plural "futile fighters"
msgstr[0] "むなしく戦う人"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'futile fighter'}
#: data/mods/Civilians/civilians.json
msgid ""
"Obviously, this aggravated yet rallied person has lost their wits and tries "
"to fight the undead with just a knife in their hands."
msgstr "奮い立ち憤るこの人物は分別を失い、ナイフだけで不死者に立ち向かおうとしています。"

#: data/mods/Civilians/civilians.json
msgid "hospitalized human"
msgid_plural "hospitalized humans"
msgstr[0] "入院患者"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hospitalized human'}
#: data/mods/Civilians/civilians.json
msgid ""
"This person is severely ill in some form or another, requiring intensive "
"care that is not available anymore after the Cataclysm.  There is nothing "
"you can do for them."
msgstr ""
"何らかの重篤な病気に罹っている患者です。集中治療が必要ですが、大変動後の世界ではそれも無理な話です。この人物のためにできることは何もありません。"

#: data/mods/Civilians/civilians.json
msgid "gawky guardian"
msgid_plural "gawky guardians"
msgstr[0] "無防備な保護者"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'gawky guardian'}
#: data/mods/Civilians/civilians.json
msgid ""
"Obsessed with finding their offspring, they scour the environment for "
"certain death."
msgstr "我が子を見つけ出すことに心を囚われ、確実に死ぬ状況で捜しまわっています。"

#: data/mods/Civilians/civilians.json
msgid "confused child"
msgid_plural "confused children"
msgstr[0] "迷子"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'confused child', 'str_pl': 'confused children'}
#: data/mods/Civilians/civilians.json
msgid ""
"Obsessed with finding their parent, they scour the environment for certain "
"death."
msgstr "親を見つけ出すことに心を囚われ、確実に死ぬ状況で捜しまわっています。"

#: data/mods/Civilians/modinfo.json
msgid "Civilians"
msgstr "追加 - 民間人"

#. ~ Description for Civilians
#: data/mods/Civilians/modinfo.json
msgid ""
"Adds a few civilian monsters & a faction that simulates the collapse of "
"civilization and the resulting riots."
msgstr "文明の崩壊とそれに伴う暴動をシミュレートするために、数体の民間人モンスターと派閥を追加します。"

#: data/mods/Civilians/monster_gun.json
msgid "Cops' Glock 22"
msgid_plural "Cops' Glock 22"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(.40口径/警官用ｸﾞﾛｯｸ22)"

#: data/mods/Civilians/monster_gun.json
msgid ""
"A gun carried by overconfident officer monsters, more inaccurate for "
"balancing reasons."
msgstr "ゲームバランスの関係上精度が低く設定されている、モンスターの思い上がった警官が扱う銃です。"

#: data/mods/Civilians/npcs.json
msgid "Militia Member"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Civilians/npcs.json
msgid "Ready to fight."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Civilians/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Futile Fighter"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Civilians/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Futile Fighter"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Profession (male Futile Fighter) description
#: data/mods/Civilians/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The cataclysm may have caught you off guard, but you're not going down "
"without a fight!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Profession (female Futile Fighter) description
#: data/mods/Civilians/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The cataclysm may have caught you off guard, but you're not going down "
"without a fight!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Civilians/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Makeshift Militia"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Civilians/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Makeshift Militia"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Profession (male Makeshift Militia) description
#: data/mods/Civilians/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You and a few neighbors grabbed whatever sticks and scraps you could find. "
"Now the cataclysm is here, and you’re a futile fighter in a makeshift "
"militia - badly equipped, badly trained, but determined to go down swinging."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Profession (female Makeshift Militia) description
#: data/mods/Civilians/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You and a few neighbors grabbed whatever sticks and scraps you could find. "
"Now the cataclysm is here, and you’re a futile fighter in a makeshift "
"militia - badly equipped, badly trained, but determined to go down swinging."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Civilians/speech.json
msgid "howling in terror."
msgstr "[恐怖に満ちた絶叫]"

#: data/mods/Civilians/speech.json
msgid "wailing in fear."
msgstr "[不安に満ちた慟哭]"

#: data/mods/Civilians/speech.json
msgid "an anguished shriek."
msgstr "[苦悶に満ちた喚声]"

#: data/mods/Civilians/speech.json
msgid "agonized crying."
msgstr "[苦悶に満ちた悲鳴]"

#: data/mods/Civilians/speech.json
msgid "faint, almost inhuman, whimpering."
msgstr "[人間とは思えないような呻き声]"

#: data/mods/Civilians/speech.json
msgid "\"Die!\""
msgstr "「死ね!」"

#: data/mods/Civilians/speech.json
msgid "\"Die, zombie scum!\""
msgstr "「死ね、糞ゾンビ!」"

#: data/mods/Civilians/speech.json
msgid "\"You'll get what's coming to you!\""
msgstr "「自業自得だ!」"

#: data/mods/Civilians/speech.json
msgid "\"Kick the bucket, filthy dead!\""
msgstr "「汚らわしい死人め、くたばれ!」"

#: data/mods/Civilians/speech.json
msgid "\"Come get some!\""
msgstr "「こっちだ!」"

#: data/mods/Civilians/speech.json
msgid "\"Will you die already?!\""
msgstr "「さっさと死ね!」"

#: data/mods/Civilians/speech.json
msgid "an unrestrained warcry."
msgstr "[粗野な雄叫び]"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_aperturepotato.json
msgid "companion potato"
msgid_plural "companion potatoes"
msgstr[0] "コンパニオンポテト"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'companion potato', 'str_pl': 'companion
#. potatoes'}
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_aperturepotato.json
msgid ""
"Seems like some kind of Genetic Lifeform and Disk Operating System, attached"
" to a potato."
msgstr ""
"ジャガイモに取り付けられた遺伝的生命形態およびディスクオペレーティングシステム(Genetic Lifeform and Disk Operating "
"System)のようなものです。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_comestibles.json
msgid "SpOreos"
msgid_plural "SpOreos"
msgstr[0] "真菌オレオ"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'SpOreos'}
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_comestibles.json
msgid ""
"The hit cookie from Mycus Industries!  Now comes in addicting flavors such "
"as Marloss, Chanterelle, and The Encroaching, Unavoidable Death of Human "
"Civilization."
msgstr ""
"ミカズ工業が販売している大人気クッキーです！マーロス味、アンズタケ味、侵略味、不可避的な人類文明滅亡味といったような、病みつきになる風味のお菓子です。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
msgid "Granade"
msgid_plural "Granades"
msgstr[0] "趣榴弾"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Granade'}
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
msgid ""
"Attached to this grenade is a name tag with the name Kevin written on it.  "
"Does not seem to work like a grenade, handle with care."
msgstr "ケビンと書かれた名札が括り付けられている手榴弾です。普通の手榴弾とは異なる効果を持つので、取り扱いには気をつけましょう。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
msgid "active Granade"
msgid_plural "active Granades"
msgstr[0] "趣榴弾(起動)"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'active Granade'}
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
msgid ""
"Attached to this grenade is a name tag with the name Kevin written on it.  "
"Does not seem to work like a grenade, handle with care.  Better throw it!"
msgstr ""
"ケビンと書かれた名札が括り付けられている手榴弾です。普通の手榴弾とは異なる効果を持つので、取り扱いには気をつけましょう。よし、勢い良く放り投げてやれ！"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
msgid "Ionic Overload Generator CBM"
msgid_plural "Ionic Overload Generator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 過重イオン発生装置"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Ionic Overload Generator CBM'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Ionic Overload Generator'}
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
msgid ""
"A powerful ion energy generator is implanted on your chest.  Fires a "
"powerful, ever-expanding energy blast.  The resulting blast ignites oxygen "
"creating fires as it moves and an explosion on impact.  Close range use is "
"highly discouraged."
msgstr ""
"使用者の胸に埋め込む、強力なイオンエネルギー発生装置です。強力で大規模なエネルギーの爆風を発射します。生じた爆風は酸素と反応し、発火と爆発を引き起こします。近距離での使用は避けてください。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
msgid "Ionic Overload Generator"
msgid_plural "Ionic Overload Generators"
msgstr[0] "過重イオン発生装置"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
msgid ""
"A powerful ion energy generator is implanted on your chest.  Fires a "
"powerful, ever-expanding energy blast that goes through various targets.  "
"The energy shot ignites oxygen creating fires as it moves and an explosion "
"on impact."
msgstr ""
"強力なイオンエネルギー発生装置が胸に埋め込まれています。強力で大規模なエネルギーの爆風を発射します。生じた爆風は酸素と反応し、発火と爆発を引き起こします。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
msgid "Yeet Cannon"
msgid_plural "Yeet Cannons"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(9mm/YEET砲)"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
msgid ""
"You can YEET all the bullets with this baby.  YEET them right into all of "
"the zombies in your path, all the hulks, the spiders, and those damned mole "
"rats."
msgstr ""
"このちびっ子を使って全弾をYEETしましょう。道中の全てのゾンビ、全ての巨体ゾンビ、クモ、クソハダカデバネズミをどんどんYEETしましょう。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'shocker zombie'}
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
msgid ""
"A human body with pale blue flesh, crackling with electrical energy.  It "
"seems eager to tell you something."
msgstr "電気エネルギーを周辺に放出しており、その人体は淡い青色に変色しています。何か伝えたがっているようです。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
msgid "mr skeltal"
msgid_plural "mr skeltals"
msgstr[0] "Mr.スケルトン"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'mr skeltal'}
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
msgid ""
"Devoid entirely of flesh and organs, this walking skeleton rattles you to "
"the bone.  In its bony hand, it holds a pristine trumpet, unmarred by the "
"end of the world."
msgstr ""
"筋肉と臓器が完全になくなったガイコツは、歩くたびに骨をカタカタと鳴らしています。骨ばった手には、滅亡した世界でもなお傷一つない綺麗なトランペットを握っています。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
msgid "minion of skeltal"
msgid_plural "minions of skeltal"
msgstr[0] "手下骸骨ゾンビ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'minion of skeltal', 'str_pl': 'minions of
#. skeltal'}
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
msgid "A lesser skeleton, raised by the forlorn dooting of a trumpet."
msgstr "トランペットの一吹きで生まれてくる小さな骸骨ゾンビです。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
msgid "Smoky bear"
msgid_plural "Smoky bears"
msgstr[0] "煙幕クマ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Smoky bear'}
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_monsters.json
msgid ""
"A smoking husk is all that remains of this once proud bear.  Its black eyes "
"gaze at you with malice… and hunger."
msgstr ""
"かつて威風堂々と森を闊歩していたであろうクマは、今や見る影もなく、身体中から煙を発しています。その漆黒の瞳からは、敵意と...飢餓が読み取れます。"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "When the testing is over, you will be missed."
msgstr "「テストが終了すれば、あなたは行方不明となってしまいます」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"Unbelievable.  You, [subject name here], must be the pride of [subject "
"hometown here]!"
msgstr "「信じられません。[被験者名]は[被験者の故郷]の誇りです」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"That thing is probably some sort of raw sewage container.  Go ahead and rub "
"your face all over it."
msgstr "「あれは、おそらく未処理下水コンテナか何かでしょう。さあ、顔をつけてみてください」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"For your own safety and the safety of others, please refrain from touching "
"[bzzzzzt]"
msgstr "「安全のため、必要ないものには触れな[ノイズ]」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"No one will blame you for giving up.  In fact, quitting at this point is a "
"perfectly reasonable response."
msgstr "中止したからといって、誰もあなたを責めることはありません。実際、現時点では、中止することが最も妥当な選択です」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"Fantastic!  You remained resolute and resourceful in an atmosphere of "
"extreme pessimism."
msgstr "「すばらしいです！ あなたは極めて悲観的な状況においても、決意と才能を発揮しました」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "Hello again.  To reiterate our previous warning: [garbled]"
msgstr "「ご機嫌いかがですか?再度警告します[ノイズ]」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "Weeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee[bzzt]"
msgstr "「せいーーーーーーーー[ノイズ]」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "If you become light headed from thirst, feel free to pass out."
msgstr "「のどが渇いてめまいを感じるようなら、気絶してもかまいませんよ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"No further compliance information is required or will be provided, and you "
"are an excellent test subject!"
msgstr "「それ以上、規制遵守に関する情報は必要ありません。あなたはすばらしい被験者です！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "Thank you for helping us help you help us all."
msgstr "「参加者の手助けをする私たちの手助けをしていただき、ありがとうございます」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"Cake and grief counseling will be available at the conclusion of the test."
msgstr "「テスト終了後には、ケーキをお出しします。また、カウンセリングもご利用になれます」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "The experiment is nearing its conclusion."
msgstr "「実験は最終段階に近づいています」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"The Enrichment Center is required to remind you that you will be baked "
"[garbled] cake."
msgstr "「あなたは焼かれ、ケーキ[ノイズ]をお伝えしなければなりません」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "We are very, very happy for your success."
msgstr "「成功してくれて、本当にうれしいです」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "We are throwing a party in honor of your tremendous success."
msgstr "「あなたの大成功を祝って、パーティーを開いてあげましょう」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "A party associate will arrive shortly to collect you for your party."
msgstr "「あなたのパーティーを開くため、すぐに仲間がやってきます」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "I know you're there.  I can feel you here."
msgstr "「そこにいるのはわかっています」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "You're not going the right way."
msgstr "「そっちではありません」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "You shouldn't be here.  This isn't safe for you."
msgstr "「ここにいてはいけません。危険です」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"Maybe you think you're helping yourself.  But you're not.  This isn't "
"helping anyone."
msgstr "「自分のためと思っているかもしれませんが、 それは違います。誰のためにもなりません」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "It's not too late to turn back."
msgstr "「早く戻ってください」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "Someone is going to get badly hurt."
msgstr "「誰かがひどいケガをすることになりますよ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"Uh oh.  Somebody cut the cake.  I told them to wait for you, but they did it"
" anyway."
msgstr "「ああ、 誰かがケーキを切ってしまいました。あなたを待つように言っておいたのですが、先走ってしまったようです」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "This is your fault.  It didn't have to be like this."
msgstr "「すべてあなたの責任です。こうなるはずではなかったのですが」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "You're not a good person.  You know that, right?"
msgstr "「あなたは悪い人です。わかってますよね？」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "Good people don't end up here."
msgstr "「良い人はこんなことにはなりません」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "You should have turned left before."
msgstr "「さっき、左に曲がっておくべきでした」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"Despite your violent behavior, the only thing you've managed to break so far"
" is my heart."
msgstr "「あなたは暴力的な行動を取りましたが、傷つけることができたのは、私の心だけです」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "What was that?  Did you say something?"
msgstr "「何です？何か言いましたか？」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"I'd just like to point out that you were given every opportunity to succeed."
msgstr "「あなたは成功のチャンスをことごとく逃しました」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "What's your point, anyway?  Survival?"
msgstr "「目的は一体何ですか？生き残ることですか？」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"You've been wrong about every single thing you've ever done, including this "
"thing."
msgstr "「今の状況を含めて、あなたのやってきたことはすべて間違いです」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"I have an infinite capacity for knowledge, and even I'm not sure what's "
"going on outside."
msgstr "「私の知識容量は無限ですが、その私にさえ、外がどうなっているのか、よくわかりません」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"Stop squirming and die like an adult or I'm going to delete your backup."
msgstr "「おとなしく死んでください。さもなければ、バックアップを消去します」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "Good job on that, by the way.  SARCASM SPHERE SELF-TEST COMPLETE."
msgstr "「とにかく、よくやってくれました。皮肉球体セルフテスト完了」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"I don't want to tell you your business, but if it were me, I'd leave that "
"thing alone."
msgstr "「余計なことを言うつもりはありませんが、私ならば、あれには干渉しないでおきますよ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"Let's be honest: Neither one of us knows what that thing does.  Just put it "
"in the corner, and I'll deal with it later."
msgstr "「正直なところ、私にも、あれが何なのかわかりません。角のところにセットしてください。あとは私がやります」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"I know you don't believe this, but everything that has happened so far was "
"for your benefit."
msgstr "「信じられないと思いますが、これまでのことはすべて、あなたのためだったのです」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"I'm checking some blueprints, and I think…  Yes, right here.  You're "
"definitely going the wrong way."
msgstr "「見取り図を確認中です。どうやら... 間違いありません。ここです。全く逆方向に進んでいます」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "Are you even listening to me?"
msgstr "「聞いていますか？」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "KEVIN SACRIFICING GAMEPLAY FOR REALISM?  THE SHOCKING TRUTH REVEALED"
msgstr "ケヴィンがリアリズムを追求するあまりゲームを破壊か？衝撃の事実が明らかに"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "TEN FACTS ABOUT THE NEW BIONIC SYSTEM THAT WILL SHOCK YOU"
msgstr "新たなCBMシステムに関する10の衝撃の真実"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "YOU WON'T BELIEVE WHO JUST ADDED A NEW PROFESSION"
msgstr "新しい職業を追加した人物、にわかには信じがたいその正体とは"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"TRIVIALIZE THE EARLY GAME WITH THIS ONE SIMPLE SPEAR WEAPON!  CONTRIBUTORS "
"HATE HIM"
msgstr "スピアさえ1本あれば、ゲーム序盤がつまらないものに！投稿者が憎んでいる彼とは"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"A MEDICAL MUTANT SET THEMSELVES ON FIRE - YOU WON'T BELIEVE WHAT HAPPENED "
"NEXT"
msgstr "医療変異者に火をつけるとどうなるか...この後信じられない衝撃の展開"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "THE TRUTH ABOUT CATACLYSM'S DEVELOPMENT - AND ITS DISGUSTING SECRET"
msgstr "Cataclysm開発の真実 - 衝撃の秘密を告白"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "IT'S TRUE - MUTAGEN IS 40% BLEACH, AND HERE'S WHY"
msgstr "紛れもない真実 - 変異原物質の原料の40%は漂白剤、その理由とは"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "20 EASY WAYS TO ESCAPE A LAB - #4 WILL BLOW YOUR MIND"
msgstr "研究所を楽に脱出する裏ワザ20連発 - 驚くこと間違いなし"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I've got a feeling we're not in Kansas anymore.\""
msgstr "「ここはカンザスじゃないみたいよ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Go ahead, make my day.\""
msgstr "「やれよ、楽しませてくれ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"You talkin' to me?\""
msgstr "「俺に用か？」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Then who the hell else are you talkin' to?\""
msgstr "「誰に言ってるんだ？」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Well I'm the only one here.\""
msgstr "「ここには俺しかおらん」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Who the fuck do you think you're talking to?\""
msgstr "「一体誰と話しているんだ？」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"What we've got here is failure to communicate.\""
msgstr "「ここにいるのは言葉の分からん男だ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"E.T.  phone home.\""
msgstr "「E.T. ウチ デンワ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I'm as mad as hell, and I'm not going to take this anymore!\""
msgstr "「もう怒った、耐えられない！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"There's no place like home.\""
msgstr "「やっぱりおうちが一番だわ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Badges?  We ain't got no badges!\""
msgstr "「バッジ？持ってねぇ！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"\"We don't need no badges!  I don't have to show you any stinking badges!\""
msgstr "「バッジなんて必要ねぇ！見せることもねぇ！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I'll be back.\""
msgstr "「アイルビーバック」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I see dead people.\""
msgstr "「死んだ人が見えるんだ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"It's alive!  It's alive!\""
msgstr "「生きてる！生きてる！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Say hello to my little friend!\""
msgstr "「これがご挨拶だ！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Here's Johnny!\""
msgstr "「お客様だよ！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Open the pod bay doors, HAL.\""
msgstr "「進入口を開けろ、HAL」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"They may take our lives, but they'll never take our freedom!\""
msgstr "「敵は我々の命を奪うことはできても、我々の自由は奪えない！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"\"If you let my daughter go now, that'll be the end of it.  I will not look "
"for you, I will not pursue you.\""
msgstr "「今すぐ娘を解放するなら、もう済んだことだ。貴様らを探しはしないし、追いかけもしない」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"\"If you don't, I will look for you, I will find you, and I will kill you.\""
msgstr "「もし娘を解放しないなら、貴様らを探し、見つけ、そして殺す」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Roads?  Where we're going, we don't need roads.\""
msgstr "「道？今から行こうとしているところには、道なんて必要ないさ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Fasten your seatbelts.  It's going to be a bumpy night.\""
msgstr "「シートベルトを締めて。今夜は荒れそうよ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"\"You've got to ask yourself one question:  'Do I feel lucky?'  Well, do ya "
"punk?\""
msgstr "「賭けてみるか、『今日はツイてるか？』って。どうなんだクソ野郎！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"You had me at hello.\""
msgstr "「最初に会った時から君に夢中だった」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Houston, we have a problem.\""
msgstr "「ヒューストン、トラブルだ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Yippie-ki-yay, motherfucker!\""
msgstr "「イッピカイエー、くそったれ！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"The first rule of The Lab is:  You do not talk about The Lab.\""
msgstr "「まずこの研究所にはルールがある。研究所のことを話してはならない」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Don't be afraid.  It's just a big, big lap dog.\""
msgstr "「怖がるなよ。ただの大きな、大きなかわいい犬だ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Bring me everyone.\""
msgstr "「総動員だ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"What do you mean everyone?\""
msgstr "「総動員とはどういう意味ですか？」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"EVERYONE!\""
msgstr "「総動員だよ！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I'm going to make him an offer he can't refuse.\""
msgstr "「文句は言わさん」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"This is the beginning of a beautiful friendship.\""
msgstr "「これが友情の始まりだ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"You can’t handle the truth!\""
msgstr "「おまえに真実は分からん！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"If you built it, he will come.\""
msgstr "「それを作れば、彼はやってくる」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hasta la vista, baby.\""
msgstr "「地獄で会おうぜ、ベイビー」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"They’re here!\""
msgstr "「あの人達よ！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Tis but a scratch!\""
msgstr "「ただのかすり傷だ！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Frankly, my dear, I don't give a damn.\""
msgstr "「俺には関係ない」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"All work and no play makes Jack a dull boy.\""
msgstr "「仕事ばかりで遊ばない、ジャックは今に気が狂う」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Remember: all I'm offering is the truth.  Nothing more.\""
msgstr "「忘れるな、見せるのはあくまでも真実だ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Don't call me Shirley.\""
msgstr "「笑ってない」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I have had it with these motherfucking snakes!\""
msgstr "「俺様はヘビも飛行機も大嫌いなんだ！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"\"Back up, put down the gun, and gimme some tropical flavored bubblicious.\""
msgstr "「そのまま、銃を置いて、風船ガムをよこせ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"And some skittles.\""
msgstr "「アメもよこせ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"You'll shoot your eye out, kid.\""
msgstr "「目を撃っちゃうわよ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Cocainum!\""
msgstr "「コカインだ！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I am your father.\""
msgstr "「私はお前の父だ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Who said that?\""
msgstr "「誰だ？」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"WHO THE FUCK SAID THAT?!\""
msgstr "「どのクソだ！？」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Bullshit!  You didn't convince me!  Show me your real war face!\""
msgstr "「それで殺せるか！気合いを入れろ！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"What is your major malfunction, numbnut?\""
msgstr "「思考回路がショートしたか、ボケが！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Leeeeeeeeeeeeeroy!  Jenkins rebuild!\""
msgstr "「リッロォォォイ！ジェンキンス、リビルド！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Activated!\""
msgstr "「起動完了！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Search mode activated!\""
msgstr "「探索モード起動！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Coming through!\""
msgstr "「接近中！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Deploying!\""
msgstr "「起動中！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Critical Error!\""
msgstr "「致命的なエラー！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Ow ow ow!\""
msgstr "「ワー、ワー、ワー！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Put me down!\""
msgstr "「下ろして！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Target lost!\""
msgstr "「ターゲットを見失いました！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Searching!\""
msgstr "「探索中！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hey!  It's me!\""
msgstr "「ちょっと！私です！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Ouch!\""
msgstr "「いたい！！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Sentry mode activated.\""
msgstr "「歩哨モードを起動します」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hi.\""
msgstr "「おーい」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Target acquired.\""
msgstr "「ターゲットを発見しました」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Dispensing product.\""
msgstr "「製品を射出します」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Firing.\""
msgstr "「発射」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hello friend.\""
msgstr "「こんにちは、私のオトモダチ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Gotcha.\""
msgstr "「捕まえた！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Is anyone there?\""
msgstr "「そこに誰かいますか？」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I see you.\""
msgstr "「見えていますよ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Could you come over here?\""
msgstr "「こちらに来ていただけませんか？」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hellooo.\""
msgstr "「ハロー」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"My fault.\""
msgstr "「私の所為です」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Ohh.\""
msgstr "「へぇー」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Critical error.\""
msgstr "「致命的なエラーです」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Shutting down.\""
msgstr "「機能停止」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I don't blame you.\""
msgstr "「あなたを責めたりしませんよ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I don't hate you.\""
msgstr "「あなたのことは嫌いではありませんよ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Whyyyy.\""
msgstr "「なぜ......」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"No hard feelings.\""
msgstr "「私は気にしませんよ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Aiaiaiaiaiai.\""
msgstr "「ワー、ワー、ワー」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "「あなたは?」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Help.\""
msgstr "「助けて」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Uh oh.\""
msgstr "「あーあ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Illegal operation.\""
msgstr "「不正な操作です」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Goodbye.\""
msgstr "「さようなら」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Sleep mode activated.\""
msgstr "「休止モードを起動します」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Your business is appreciated.\""
msgstr "「ご利用どうも！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hibernating.\""
msgstr "「眠りにつきます」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Goodnight.\""
msgstr "「おやすみなさい」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Resting.\""
msgstr "「休憩中」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Nap time.\""
msgstr "「お昼寝の時間です」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Are you still there?\""
msgstr "「まだそこにいますか？」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hey, it's me!\""
msgstr "「ちょっと、私です！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Don't shoot!\""
msgstr "「撃たないで！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"\""
msgstr "\"\""

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Stop shooting!\""
msgstr "「撃つのをやめてください！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Self test error.\""
msgstr "「自己診断テストにてエラーが発生しました」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Aah.\""
msgstr "「オーゥ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Unknown error.\""
msgstr "「未知のエラーが発生しました」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Malfunctioning.\""
msgstr "「動作を行えません」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Aaaah.\""
msgstr "「アーァオ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Ow ow ow ow owww.\""
msgstr "「アワワワワーォ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Why?\""
msgstr "「なあぜ？」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I did everything you asked!\""
msgstr "「言われたことはやったのに!」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I don't understand!\""
msgstr "「意味がわかりません！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I'm fine!\""
msgstr "「私は壊れてません！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Wheeeeee-OH NO!\""
msgstr "「わーーー...そんな！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I'm scared!\""
msgstr "「怖い！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Come closer.\""
msgstr "「もっと近くに来てよ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Something's wrong…\""
msgstr "「なにか変...」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"What are you doing?\""
msgstr "「何をしているの？」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Please stop.\""
msgstr "「やめて」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"You've made your point.\""
msgstr "「もうわかりました」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Okay, you win.\""
msgstr "「いいわ、あなたの勝ち」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"This is not good.\""
msgstr "「これはマズいわ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Excuse me?\""
msgstr "「すみません」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I'm different…\""
msgstr "「私は違うの...」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Thanks anyway…\""
msgstr "「でもありがとう...」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Take me with you…\""
msgstr "「私を連れて行って...」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"You have excellent aim!\""
msgstr "「いい腕ですね！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I need backup!\""
msgstr "「バックアップが必要です！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I never liked her.\""
msgstr "「彼女はキライでした」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"These things happen.\""
msgstr " 「仕方ないです」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"That was nobody's fault.\""
msgstr " 「誰のせいでもありません」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"She was provoking you.\""
msgstr "「彼女、あなたを挑発してたから」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Oh dear.\""
msgstr " 「あらまあ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Oh my!\""
msgstr "「なんてこと」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I blame myself.\""
msgstr "「私のせい」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"He probably deserved it.\""
msgstr "「当然の報いです」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I saw it.  It was an accident.\""
msgstr "「見たわ。あれは事故よ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"She's probably okay.\""
msgstr "「彼女ならきっと大丈夫」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Noted.\""
msgstr "「確認」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"But I need to protect the humans!\""
msgstr "「だけど人間を守らなくては！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"We're back!\""
msgstr "「戻ったぜ！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hi there!\""
msgstr "「よお！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Back again!\""
msgstr "「また来たぜ！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Well, hello, stranger!\""
msgstr "「よう、知らないやつ！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"This time is OUR time.\""
msgstr "「今回は俺たちが主役だぜ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Second time's a charm…\""
msgstr "「二度目の正直...」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Howdy, stranger!\""
msgstr "「オッス」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Thought you'd seen the last of us, didn't ya?\""
msgstr "「俺が死んじまったと思ってただろ？おマエ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Dang!\""
msgstr "「チッ！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I thought we fixed that.\""
msgstr "「片付いたと思ってたのにな」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"What's a guy gotta got to do to get some bullets around here?\""
msgstr "「どうすりゃいいかってコトぐらい、わかるだろうがよ！？」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Nope.  Still can't see.\""
msgstr "「まだ見えねえ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Yep.  Still blind.\""
msgstr "「ああ。まだ見えねえよ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Click click click!  Still defective!\""
msgstr "「カチカチカチ！まだイカれたまんまだぜ！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Yeah, that's right!  Still defective!\""
msgstr "「あー、そうさ！まだイカれてやがる！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Yeah!  Still not working.\""
msgstr "「ああ！まだダメだ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Yeah!  Non-lethal as ever.\""
msgstr "「そうさ！全くもって役立たずだね」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Can't.  See.  A.  Thing.\""
msgstr "「なーんも、見えちゃ、いねーぜ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Absolutely no improvement.\""
msgstr "「一向によくなる気配はないな」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Not getting better with age!\""
msgstr "「待ってても全然よくなんねえ！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"This is just getting embarrassing.\""
msgstr "「恥ずかしくなってきたぜ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Alright, you can go.\""
msgstr "「おマエ、もういい」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"[sigh] Don't tell anyone about this.\""
msgstr "「[ため息] 誰にも言うなよ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Well, I tried.  Best of luck!\""
msgstr "「俺じゃダメだ。後は任せたぜ！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hey, safe travels, there.\""
msgstr "「気をつけて行けよ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hey, thanks so much!\""
msgstr "「おー、ありがとよ！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Don't be a stranger!\""
msgstr "「水くせえなあ！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"It's been a pleasure!\""
msgstr "「楽しかったぜ！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"That was fun, wasn't it?\""
msgstr "「楽しかったな」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid ""
"\"I can't see a thing.  What just happened?  Better open fire!  [click click"
" click click]  Dang!\""
msgstr "「なんも見えねェ。一体何が起きた？とりあえず攻撃だ！[カチカチカチカチカチカチカチカチ] クソッ！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"*clicking noises*\""
msgstr "*カチッ*"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"No, wait, wait!\""
msgstr "「うわ、待て待て！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hey, hold on now WHOA WHOA WHOA!\""
msgstr "「おい、ちょっと待...うわうわうわ！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Oh, this is ridiculous!\""
msgstr "「なんだよ、話にならないぜ！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Give me another channnnce!\""
msgstr "「もう一度チャンスをくれよー！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Hey!  Squeaky-voice!  Gimme some of your bullets!\""
msgstr "「おいキーキー声！おマエの弾をかせ！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Can I get some bullets here?  Anybody got bullets?\""
msgstr "「弾をくれよ、誰か持ってねェのか？」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Uhhh, no bullets.  Sorry.\""
msgstr "「えっと...弾はねえ。悪いな」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Shootin' blanks every time, ALL the time.\""
msgstr "「撃つのはいつだって空砲だけどな」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Standing down.\""
msgstr "「一時休戦だ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Watch and learn, everybody.  Watch and learn.\""
msgstr "「みんな、よく見て学ぶんだぜ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"So what am I, uh, supposed to do here?\""
msgstr "俺...ここで何すりゃいいんだ？」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Identify yourself or I will shoot.\""
msgstr "「名乗らないんならブチ抜くぜ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"Pleased to meetcha.\""
msgstr "「お目にかかれて光栄だぜ」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "\"I'm gonna make you proud!\""
msgstr "「やってやるぜ！」"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_vehicles.json
msgid "Flaming Atomic Car"
msgstr "武装アトミックカー"

#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/modinfo.json
msgid "Crazy Cataclysm"
msgstr "追加 - クレイジー・カタクリズム"

#. ~ Description for Crazy Cataclysm
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/modinfo.json
msgid "Want a little crazy in your Cataclysm?  Try this one."
msgstr "ちょっとクレイジーなCataclysmを楽しみたい？こちらをお試しあれ。"

#: data/mods/Dangerous Fungi/modinfo.json
msgid "Dangerous Fungi"
msgstr "変更 - 危険な真菌"

#. ~ Description for Dangerous Fungi
#: data/mods/Dangerous Fungi/modinfo.json
msgid ""
"Allows infestation of non-dirt tiles. Allows fungal breed through fungal "
"stalk."
msgstr "非土壌のタイルへの侵入を許可します。キノコの根を通じて菌類の繁殖を許可します。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/lab_notes.json
msgid ""
"Research on our visitors is proceeding nicely.  The raptor DNA is of special"
" interest, with some novel protein chains that may lead to medical "
"breakthroughs."
msgstr ""
"来訪者に関する研究は順調に進んでいる。ラプトルのDNAは、医学的なブレイクスルーに繋がる可能性のある新種のタンパク質鎖を持っており、特に興味深い。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/lab_notes.json
msgid ""
"Research proceeds apace on our visitors.  While Operation Major Laser did "
"not receive enough funding as hoped, our more humble bio-operator protocols "
"were already prepared and are proceeding ahead of schedule.  The hosts are "
"most receptive to improvement."
msgstr ""
"訪問者たちの研究は着実に進んでいる。大型レーザー作戦は十分な資金を得られなかったが、次善策の改造兵士については既に準備が整っており、予定よりも前倒しで進んでいる。改造希望者は多数用意できる。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/lab_notes.json
msgid ""
"Dr. Yoshimi has been reprimanded for unauthorized contact with the "
"procompsignathids.  Disgusting behavior, and a terrible example to the "
"junior researchers."
msgstr "プロコンプソグナトゥスと不正に接触したとして、ヨシミ博士は懲戒処分を受けた。実に嫌なやり口だ。後輩研究者への見せしめじゃないか。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/lab_notes.json
msgid ""
"Dr. Yoshimi has escaped, along with an unknown number of dinosaurs.  "
"Unfortunately, we have bigger problems with XE037."
msgstr "ヨシミ博士が、無数の恐竜たちと共に行方不明になってしまった。残念ながら、今はXE037というもっと重大な問題がある。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/lab_notes.json
msgid ""
"Strange sounds have been reported from the swamp nearby.  An enhanced "
"security team was dispatched, but has not returned in 48 hours.  The "
"facility is on lockdown.  We can’t let them get back in."
msgstr ""
"付近の沼地で妙な音が聞こえるという報告があった。武装した警備班が派遣されたが、48時間経っても戻って来ない。施設は封鎖されている。帰りを待つこともできない。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/lab_notes.json
msgid ""
"Tingle lab situation normal.  Dr. Tingle believes the Acrocanthosaurus is "
"the best fit for hybridization and Tingle lab is working on safety protocols"
" to provide the needed material to Dr. Tingle.  Velociraptor is another "
"possibility given prior research.  Testing with chickens and the "
"velociraptor specimens suggests some resistance."
msgstr ""
"ティンゴ研究所の状況は正常です。ティングル博士は、アクロカントサウルスがハイブリッド化に最適であると考えており、研究所は博士に必要な材料を提供するための安全プロトコルを準備しています。過去の研究を考慮すると、ヴェロキラプトルも候補にとして挙げられています。ニワトリとヴェロキラプトルの標本を使用したテストでは、ある程度の抵抗性が示しています。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/lab_notes.json
msgid ""
"Tingle lab situation critical.  Dr. Tingle violated safety protocols last "
"night and attempted to secure genetic material directly, possibly under the "
"influence of some drug or toxin, given the anatomical impossibility and "
"danger of the procedure.  The Acrocanthosaurus specimen has escaped into the"
" facility."
msgstr ""
"ティングル研究室は危機的状況です。昨夜ティングル博士が保安プロトコルに違反し、遺伝子試料を直接確保しようとしました。これは解剖学的に不可能であり、手順も危険を伴うため、博士は何らかの薬物や毒物の影響下にあった可能性があります。また試料のアクロカントサウルスが、施設内から脱走しています。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/modinfo.json
