#. 'str_pl': 'boiled leather bear bardings with caparison'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_bear_armor.json
msgid ""
"A full barding for bears, consisting of boiled leather with cloth "
"underneath.  This caparison depicts four men in heavy metal armor riddled "
"with bullet marks.  You could put this on a friendly bear."
msgstr ""
"硬化革と布で作られた、バーディングと呼ばれる熊鎧一式です。布飾りには、弾痕が残る重金属鎧を着た4人の男性が描かれています。友好的なクマに装着できます。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_bear_armor.json
msgid ""
"A full barding for bears, consisting of boiled leather with cloth "
"underneath.  This caparison depicts a large brown bear being swarmed by bees"
" as it devours a honeycomb.  You could put this on a friendly bear."
msgstr ""
"硬化革と布で作られた、バーディングと呼ばれる熊鎧一式です。布飾りには、ハチの巣を襲って食べる大きなヒグマが描かれています。友好的なクマに装着できます。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_bear_armor.json
msgid ""
"A full barding for bears, consisting of boiled leather with cloth "
"underneath.  This caparison depicts a warrior-woman holding a baby in one "
"arm and a battleaxe in the other.  You could put this on a friendly bear."
msgstr ""
"硬化革と布で作られた、バーディングと呼ばれる熊鎧一式です。布飾りには、赤ん坊と戦斧をそれぞれの手に抱えた女性の戦士が描かれています。友好的なクマに装着できます。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/pets_bear_armor.json
msgid ""
"A full barding for bears, consisting of boiled leather with cloth "
"underneath.  This caparison depicts a bear dancing with a golden-haired "
"maiden.  You could put this on a friendly bear."
msgstr ""
"硬化革と布で作られた、バーディングと呼ばれる熊鎧一式です。布飾りには、金色の髪の乙女と踊るクマが描かれています。友好的なクマに装着できます。"

