#. ~ Description for black dragon scale
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid ""
"A scale from a black dragon.  It still has its magical properties and acid "
"resistance."
msgstr "ブラックドラゴンの鱗です。魔法の力と耐酸性を維持しています。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
