msgstr[0] "粗皮(ブラックドラゴン)"

#. ~ Description for raw black dragon hide
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid ""
"A carefully folded raw hide harvested from a black dragon.  It is a large "
"enough piece that it is workable to make armor, and with enough scales you "
"could make scale mail."
msgstr "ブラックドラゴンから剥ぎ取って丁寧に折り畳んだ生の皮です。防具を作るのに十分な大きさがあり、鱗があれば竜鱗の鎧を製作できます。"

