#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Nekomimi'}
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/thresh_mutation.json
msgid ""
"The age of man has ended, the age of catgirls is upon us!  After becoming a "
"neko, you've found yourself wanting to… open a bakery?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Inumimi'}
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/thresh_mutation.json
msgid ""
"Humanity has gone from taming dogs to becoming them!  You've acquired a "
"sudden desire to… become a witch?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Ushimimi'}
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/thresh_mutation.json
msgid ""
"Becoming so cow-like has rendered you unable to even think about eating "
"meat, especially beef.  You occaisonally find yourself wishing you had a "
"human pal to protect, and maybe more."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Kumamimi'}
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/thresh_mutation.json
msgid ""
"Some part of you is telling you to just go in a cave and sleep this whole "
"cataclysm thing off.  But the rest of you knows very well that you need to "
"use your newfound strength for good."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Nezumimi'}
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/thresh_mutation.json
msgid ""
"You initially found yourself worried about what others might think of you "
"now… fortunately, they're very cheesed to meet you!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Arachnae'}
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/thresh_mutation.json
msgid ""
"The spider part of you is perfectly happy with your substitution of zombies "
"for flies, and so is your human side.  You've found yourself wanting to open"
" an underground bakery after this is all over."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Harpy'}
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/thresh_mutation.json
msgid ""
"The Wright Brothers **wish** they could have flown like you do.  The zombies"
" stand no chance, now that you can swoop down from above!  Part of you "
"wishes you could build a house on a floating sky island, though…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Dryad'}
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/thresh_mutation.json
msgid ""
"You've found yourself enjoying and communing with nature even more since you"
" became so intertwined with it and the nature talks back.  Once this is all "
"over and natural order has been restored, you'll *have* to start a "
"conservationist group."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Slime'}
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/thresh_mutation.json
msgid ""
"Your anything-but-newtonian body is soo bendy and stretchy!  It gives you "
"plenty of mischevious ideas of what to do with them later… but for now, "
"you'll have to settle for having fun returning those zombies to their grave."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Fey'}
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/thresh_mutation.json
msgid ""
"You've found yourself with an incredible craving for lembas, as well as a "
"strong desire to nock an arrow to a bow.  The trees speak to you, and you "
"speak back.  In the darkest hour of mankind, the fae shall bring the light!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Kitsune'}
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/thresh_mutation.json
msgid ""
"While you may not have gained the magical powers of the japanese fox "
"spirits, you embody their mischievous nature perfectly.  Perhaps one day, "
"you'll find that special partner-in-crime to live up to the other reputation"
" Kitsunes have."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Usagimimi'}
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/thresh_mutation.json
msgid ""
"Those playboys hussies are just a bunch of posers, here's a REAL bunnygirl!"
"  Those zombies are practically tortoises compared to you now, and you look "
"stunning while doing it!  Something tells you it's gonna be a challenge to "
"find a partner that can keep up with you…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Lamia'}
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/thresh_mutation.json
msgid ""
"You have to put in a lot of care to keep your scales smooth and shiny, but "
"it's worth it.  All you need now is a nice warm rock to bask on, or someone "
"to coil around for warmth…"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/modinfo.json
msgid "My Sweet Cataclysm: BN Edition"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for My Sweet Cataclysm: BN Edition
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/modinfo.json
msgid ""
"In the wake of the Cataclysm sweets and snacks are coming to life.  You "
"could be one of them and walk through the Cataclysm as a human shaped piece "
"of sugar with your pet necco wafer, or you could just hunt them for some "
"sweet treats."
msgstr ""
"大変動の結果、お菓子に命が宿りました。人間の形をした砂糖の塊としてペットのラムネ菓子と一緒に大変動の世界を冒険することも、甘いご褒美を狩りに出掛けることもできます。"

