"All the parts necessary to convert an L523 to a Designated Marksman Rifle, "
"suitable for long-ranged work.  In order to reconfigure an already-"
"configured L523, you'll need to disassemble it to the base platform, then "
"assemble with the parts you prefer."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/exotic_ammo/generic/leadworks.json
msgid "L523-LMG conversion"
msgid_plural "L523-LMG conversion"
msgstr[0] ""

